    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fa7065c044ddf9042c8e",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Edit the [`root_url`](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#root_url) setting in each node's `grafana.ini` configuration file to reflect the cluster's shared hostname.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana for high availability",
        "Grafana Enterprise only: License your Grafana servers"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-for-high-availability.md",
