    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c024efc412acda209f3d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana Alerting provides a high availability mode. It preserves the semantics of legacy dashboard alerting by executing all alerts on every server and by sending notifications only once per alert. Load distribution between servers is not supported at this time.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana for high availability",
        "Alerting high availability"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-for-high-availability.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c062f95093d6934f74ec259d0b58a6383e98bcfc",
        "sha256": "ec32ff77a81b14e759047e100991ddaad6eb078cd11b755fb6657c243078eb27",
        "lineStart": 58,
        "lineEnd": 58,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-for-high-availability.md#L58-L58"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f4e4aa43dbc3c5d80426",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For further information and instructions on setting up alerting high availability, refer to [Enable alerting high availability](../../alerting/set-up/configure-high-availability/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana for high availability",
        "Alerting high availability"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-for-high-availability.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c062f95093d6934f74ec259d0b58a6383e98bcfc",
        "sha256": "ec32ff77a81b14e759047e100991ddaad6eb078cd11b755fb6657c243078eb27",
        "lineStart": 60,
        "lineEnd": 60,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-for-high-availability.md#L60-L60"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.97272b070c02a7f54ace",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Legacy Grafana Alerting supports a limited form of high availability. In this model, alert notifications are deduplicated when running multiple servers. This means all alerts are executed on every server, but alert notifications are only sent once per alert. Grafana does not support load distribution between servers.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana for high availability",
        "Alerting high availability"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-for-high-availability.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c062f95093d6934f74ec259d0b58a6383e98bcfc",
        "sha256": "ec32ff77a81b14e759047e100991ddaad6eb078cd11b755fb6657c243078eb27",
        "lineStart": 64,
        "lineEnd": 64,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-for-high-availability.md#L64-L64"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a9dcd13c33da97b0245d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana Live works with limitations in highly available setup. For details, refer to the [Configure Grafana Live HA setup](../set-up-grafana-live/#configure-grafana-live-ha-setup).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana for high availability",
        "Grafana Live"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-for-high-availability.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c062f95093d6934f74ec259d0b58a6383e98bcfc",
        "sha256": "ec32ff77a81b14e759047e100991ddaad6eb078cd11b755fb6657c243078eb27",
        "lineStart": 68,
        "lineEnd": 68,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-for-high-availability.md#L68-L68"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8b6a31c31df3b9b4782d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana uses auth token strategy with database by default. This means that a load balancer can send a user to any Grafana server without having to log in on each server.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana for high availability",
        "User sessions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-for-high-availability.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c062f95093d6934f74ec259d0b58a6383e98bcfc",
        "sha256": "ec32ff77a81b14e759047e100991ddaad6eb078cd11b755fb6657c243078eb27",
        "lineStart": 72,
        "lineEnd": 72,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-for-high-availability.md#L72-L72"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4daa764424c311ee6a4c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana Live is a real-time messaging engine you can use to push event data to a frontend as soon as an event occurs.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 22,
        "lineEnd": 22,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L22-L22"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.893ec270f3f67e0d4c17",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This could be notifications about dashboard changes, new frames for rendered data, and so on. Live features can help eliminate a page reload or polling in many places, it can stream Internet of things (IoT) sensors or any other real-time data to panels.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 24,
        "lineEnd": 24,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L24-L24"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9078825b8316ea867cff",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By `real-time`, we indicate a soft real-time. Due to network latencies, garbage collection cycles, and so on, the delay of a delivered message can be up to several hundred milliseconds or higher.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 27,
        "lineEnd": 27,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L27-L27"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.37dc8a1c7c2152840172",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Handling persistent connections like WebSocket in scale may require operating system and infrastructure tuning. That's why by default Grafana Live supports 100 simultaneous connections max. For more details on how to tune this limit, refer to [Live configuration section](#configure-grafana-live).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Concepts"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 34,
        "lineEnd": 34,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L34-L34"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e1d8060e990638c3d7f4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "As soon as there is a change to the dashboard layout, it is automatically reflected on other devices connected to Grafana Live.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Features",
        "Dashboard change notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 42,
        "lineEnd": 42,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L42-L42"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.539c92c66f38a994aad3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "With Grafana Live, backend data source plugins can stream updates to frontend panels.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Features",
        "Data streaming from plugins"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 46,
        "lineEnd": 46,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L46-L46"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.71a9d7ce95b63cbe391d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The basic streaming example included in Grafana core streams frames with some generated data to a panel. To look at it create a new panel and point it to the `-- Grafana --` data source. Next, choose `Live Measurements` and select the `plugin/testdata/random-20Hz-stream` channel.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Features",
        "Data streaming from plugins"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 54,
        "lineEnd": 54,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L54-L54"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.89253a206140bbe3418e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A new API endpoint `/api/live/push/:streamId` allows accepting metrics data in InfluxDB line protocol format from Telegraf. These metrics are transformed into Grafana data frames and published to channels.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Features",
        "Data streaming from Telegraf"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 58,
        "lineEnd": 58,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L58-L58"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d7d15cbadb61c8e5eb56",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Important:** When streaming data from Telegraf, ensure that:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Features",
        "Data streaming from Telegraf"
      ],
      "source": {
