    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.290b48e59e4671cdb2a2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When data is received via the HTTP Push API, it is automatically transformed into Grafana data frames and published to the appropriate channels for visualization.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Grafana Live channel",
        "Data format",
        "HTTP Push API"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 130,
        "lineEnd": 130,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L130-L130"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ee996f705f37860df985",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana Live is enabled by default. In Grafana v8.0, it has a strict default for a maximum number of connections per Grafana server instance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Configure Grafana Live"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 136,
        "lineEnd": 136,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L136-L136"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fc7c3c10d205db0ef804",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "WebSocket is a persistent connection that starts with an HTTP Upgrade request (using the same HTTP port as the rest of Grafana) and then switches to a TCP mode where WebSocket frames can travel in both directions between a client and a server. Each logged-in user opens a WebSocket connection – one per browser tab.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Configure Grafana Live",
        "Max number of connections"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 142,
        "lineEnd": 142,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L142-L142"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4d8a264e35200f96d909",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The number of maximum WebSocket connections users can establish with Grafana is limited to 100 by default. See [max_connections](../configure-grafana/#max_connections) option.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Configure Grafana Live",
        "Max number of connections"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 144,
        "lineEnd": 144,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L144-L144"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cb92e6bb01268541cdb2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In case you want to increase this limit, ensure that your server and infrastructure allow handling more connections. The following sections discuss several common problems which could happen when managing persistent connections, in particular WebSocket connections.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Configure Grafana Live",
        "Max number of connections"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 146,
        "lineEnd": 146,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L146-L146"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
