      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.de255714019bf75a5b71",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, Live accepts connections with Origin header that matches configured [root_url](../configure-grafana/#root_url) (which is a public Grafana URL).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Configure Grafana Live",
        "Request origin check"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 152,
        "lineEnd": 152,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L152-L152"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ff1c2a05cd1bed649e25",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "It is possible to provide a list of additional origin patterns to allow WebSocket connections from. This can be achieved using the [allowed_origins](../configure-grafana/#allowed_origins) option of Grafana Live configuration.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Configure Grafana Live",
        "Request origin check"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 154,
        "lineEnd": 154,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L154-L154"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f724403baaa72d0f59bc",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Each persistent connection costs some memory on a server. Typically, this should be about 50 KB per connection at this moment. Thus a server with 1 GB RAM is expected to handle about 20k connections max. Each active connection consumes additional CPU resources since the client and server send PING/PONG frames to each other to maintain a connection.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Configure Grafana Live",
        "Request origin check",
        "Resource usage"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 158,
        "lineEnd": 158,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L158-L158"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a2a561bccf27e848162c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Using the streaming functionality results in additional CPU usage. The exact CPU resource utilization can be hard to estimate as it heavily depends on the Grafana Live usage pattern.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Configure Grafana Live",
        "Request origin check",
        "Resource usage"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 160,
        "lineEnd": 160,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L160-L160"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5ee586dbbbc21796b220",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Each WebSocket connection costs a file descriptor on a server machine where Grafana runs. Most operating systems have a quite low default limit for the maximum number of descriptors that process can open.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Configure Grafana Live",
        "Request origin check",
        "Open file limit"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 164,
        "lineEnd": 164,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L164-L164"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.37beae3347dd402f34ef",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "On a Linux system, you can also check out the current limits for a running process with:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Configure Grafana Live",
        "Request origin check",
        "Open file limit"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 172,
        "lineEnd": 172,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L172-L172"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2629c780565178a47bfb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The open files limit shows approximately how many user connections your server can currently handle.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Configure Grafana Live",
        "Request origin check",
        "Open file limit"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 178,
        "lineEnd": 178,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L178-L178"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e13c88923db2c130af2b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Ephemeral port exhaustion problem can happen between your load balancer (or reverse proxy) software and Grafana server. For example, when you load balance requests/connections between different Grafana instances. If you connect directly to a single Grafana server instance, then you should not come across this issue.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Configure Grafana Live",
        "Request origin check",
        "Ephemeral port exhaustion"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 184,
        "lineEnd": 184,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L184-L184"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.168b5e81ac205845e018",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, on load balancer/server boundary you are limited to 65535 possible variants. But actually, due to some OS limits (for example on Unix available ports defined in `ip_local_port_range` sysctl parameter) and sockets in TIME_WAIT state, the number is even less.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Configure Grafana Live",
        "Request origin check",
        "Ephemeral port exhaustion"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 192,
        "lineEnd": 192,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L192-L192"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2dfb98fe2cf4fd083366",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In order to eliminate a problem you can:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Configure Grafana Live",
        "Request origin check",
        "Ephemeral port exhaustion"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0aa7adff7477bf1c9cc08fa8d9bf3408b5a587b2",
        "sha256": "6a26e75e2110d530ee4277995d1c57bed1fd7312df4d2c2e40d2e5bafd3b9eab",
        "lineStart": 194,
        "lineEnd": 194,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md#L194-L194"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
