    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e6bb2234a285d0f7652a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To bypass these limitations, Grafana has a Live HA engine that requires Redis to work.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up Grafana Live",
        "Configure Grafana Live HA setup"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/setup-grafana/set-up-grafana-live.md",
