      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Check the config to ensure the `http_addr` is left blank, allowing Grafana to bind to all interfaces. If you have set `http_addr` to a specific subdomain, such as `subdomain.mysite.com`, this might prevent the Grafana process from binding to an external address, due to network address translation layers being present.",
