    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.960fb290e431c611346c",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "b. Edit `custom.ini` and uncomment the `http_port` configuration option (`;` is the comment character in ini files) and change it to something similar to `8080`, which should not require extra Windows privileges.",
