    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8f2e54f3ccdf3cca63ed",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Alerting Provisioning HTTP API can be used to create, modify, and delete resources relevant to Grafana-managed alerts. This API is the one used by our [Grafana Terraform provider](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/grafana/grafana/latest/docs).",
      "headingPath": [],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/alerts/alerting_provisioning.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "aa2d47b881f09b496f3b438a9487a05b56c65ff4",
        "sha256": "3b548e3122c7859f6f6838cf99ef98b72faf15a00837f7eb7cc4ded8eef49dfb",
        "lineStart": 9,
        "lineEnd": 9,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/alerts/alerting_provisioning.md#L9-L9"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7cf6710b09dd9e39809c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "> If you are running Grafana Enterprise, you need to add specific permissions for some endpoints. For more information, refer to [Role-based access control permissions](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/custom-role-actions-scopes/).",
      "headingPath": [],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/alerts/alerting_provisioning.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "aa2d47b881f09b496f3b438a9487a05b56c65ff4",
        "sha256": "3b548e3122c7859f6f6838cf99ef98b72faf15a00837f7eb7cc4ded8eef49dfb",
        "lineStart": 11,
        "lineEnd": 11,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/alerts/alerting_provisioning.md#L11-L11"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2cf53722206ff0a47ab1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The contact points, notification policies, notification template groups, and mute timings endpoints in this API are deprecated and will be removed in a future release. Use the [Grafana App Platform alerting APIs](https://editor.swagger.io/?url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/main/packages/grafana-openapi/src/apis/notifications.alerting.grafana.app-v1beta1.json) instead.",
      "headingPath": [],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/alerts/alerting_provisioning.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "aa2d47b881f09b496f3b438a9487a05b56c65ff4",
        "sha256": "3b548e3122c7859f6f6838cf99ef98b72faf15a00837f7eb7cc4ded8eef49dfb",
        "lineStart": 14,
        "lineEnd": 14,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/alerts/alerting_provisioning.md#L14-L14"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.313c807d1fd54796c1b6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In the Alerting provisioning HTTP API, the endpoints use a JSON format that differs from the format returned by the `export` endpoints.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana-managed endpoints"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/alerts/alerting_provisioning.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "aa2d47b881f09b496f3b438a9487a05b56c65ff4",
        "sha256": "3b548e3122c7859f6f6838cf99ef98b72faf15a00837f7eb7cc4ded8eef49dfb",
        "lineStart": 20,
        "lineEnd": 20,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/alerts/alerting_provisioning.md#L20-L20"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.99c76af53897b6e5cbdc",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The `export` endpoints allow you to export alerting resources in a JSON format suitable for [provisioning via files](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/alerting/set-up/provision-alerting-resources/file-provisioning/). However, this format cannot be used to update resources via the HTTP API.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana-managed endpoints"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/alerts/alerting_provisioning.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "aa2d47b881f09b496f3b438a9487a05b56c65ff4",
        "sha256": "3b548e3122c7859f6f6838cf99ef98b72faf15a00837f7eb7cc4ded8eef49dfb",
        "lineStart": 22,
        "lineEnd": 22,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/alerts/alerting_provisioning.md#L22-L22"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f195424a1c478e93bbe6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The following endpoints can be used to manage both alert rules and recording rules. To create a recording rule, include a `record` block in your request instead of a `condition` field.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana-managed endpoints",
        "Alert rules"
      ],
      "source": {
