    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.28e963a869079d7f0838",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Pre-provisioned Loki and Prometheus data source-managed alerts have been deprecated in Grafana Cloud and can not be created in new stacks. New Grafana Cloud stacks will use Grafana-managed alerting (GMA) by default. Datasource-managed alerting (DMA) is not provisioned in new stacks. Existing stacks are not affected.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana-managed endpoints",
        "Data source-managed resources"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/alerts/alerting_provisioning.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "aa2d47b881f09b496f3b438a9487a05b56c65ff4",
        "sha256": "3b548e3122c7859f6f6838cf99ef98b72faf15a00837f7eb7cc4ded8eef49dfb",
        "lineStart": 605,
        "lineEnd": 606,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/alerts/alerting_provisioning.md#L605-L606"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.28efcbead73cd1faf96f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This applies to the default Loki and Prometheus Grafana Cloud data sources managed by Grafana Labs and Cloud Alertmanager, which will not be available nor will Grafana provision the data source for it. If you add your own Mimir, Loki, or Alertmanager data sources, you can continue to use data source-managed alerts.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana-managed endpoints",
        "Data source-managed resources"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/alerts/alerting_provisioning.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "aa2d47b881f09b496f3b438a9487a05b56c65ff4",
        "sha256": "3b548e3122c7859f6f6838cf99ef98b72faf15a00837f7eb7cc4ded8eef49dfb",
        "lineStart": 608,
        "lineEnd": 608,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/alerts/alerting_provisioning.md#L608-L608"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.69da790d3df915129fdc",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Cloud users can import DMA rules into GMA rules with the import tool. See the [import data source-managed alerts to Grafana-managed alerts documentation](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/alerting/alerting-rules/alerting-migration/) for information on how to do this.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana-managed endpoints",
        "Data source-managed resources"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/alerts/alerting_provisioning.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "aa2d47b881f09b496f3b438a9487a05b56c65ff4",
        "sha256": "3b548e3122c7859f6f6838cf99ef98b72faf15a00837f7eb7cc4ded8eef49dfb",
        "lineStart": 610,
        "lineEnd": 610,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/alerts/alerting_provisioning.md#L610-L610"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.246bc7ab68d6ec289184",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This API is deprecated and will be removed in a future release. Use the Grafana App Platform alerting APIs instead: `/apis/rules.alerting.grafana.app/v0alpha1/namespaces/{namespace}/alertrules/{name}` for alert rules and `/apis/rules.alerting.grafana.app/v0alpha1/namespaces/{namespace}/recordingrules/{name}` for recording rules.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana-managed endpoints",
        "Paths",
        "<span id=\"route-delete-alert-rule\"></span> Delete a specific alert rule by UID. (_RouteDeleteAlertRule_)"
      ],
      "source": {
