      "sourceText": "This API is deprecated and will be removed in a future release. Use the Grafana App Platform alerting APIs instead: `/apis/rules.alerting.grafana.app/v0alpha1/namespaces/{namespace}/alertrules` for alert rules and `/apis/rules.alerting.grafana.app/v0alpha1/namespaces/{namespace}/recordingrules` for recording rules.",
