      "sourceText": "The function of [Mute timing and active timing](ref:shared-mute-timings) differs from [silences](ref:shared-silences), as they are two are distinct methods to suppress notifications. They do not prevent alert rules from being evaluated or stop alert instances from appearing in the user interface; they only prevent notifications from being created.",
