      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.61a1d7acbe6512fcaea8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can create reusable templates that can be executed from other templates or within the same template.",
      "headingPath": [
        "If",
        "Templates"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/alerts/template-language.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "427eb58c6a1cfc572bc2d219347c9d479fc74d83",
        "sha256": "2ec4cfb1a6f5d411460dc0daf71bcbdcb3d69327597eb7fedf4af39ec2d594ee",
        "lineStart": 113,
        "lineEnd": 113,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/alerts/template-language.md#L113-L113"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.989fccaee81eeabd7545",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You should not define templates with the same name as other templates, including default templates such as `__subject`, `__text_values_list`, `__text_alert_list`, `default.title` and `default.message`. Where a template has been created with the same name as a default template, or a template in another notification template, Grafana might use either template. Grafana does not prevent, or show an error message, when there are two or more templates with the same name.",
      "headingPath": [
        "If",
        "Templates"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/alerts/template-language.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "427eb58c6a1cfc572bc2d219347c9d479fc74d83",
        "sha256": "2ec4cfb1a6f5d411460dc0daf71bcbdcb3d69327597eb7fedf4af39ec2d594ee",
        "lineStart": 122,
        "lineEnd": 122,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/alerts/template-language.md#L122-L122"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2b49a030ce98aa627582",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can execute defined templates using `template`, the name of the template in double quotes, and the cursor that should be passed to the template:",
      "headingPath": [
        "If",
        "Templates",
        "Execute templates"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/alerts/template-language.md",
