      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For more information on where to find configuration files, refer to [Configuration file location](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#configuration-file-location).",
      "headingPath": [
