    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3b06dc64617b23269e9f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "We recommend that you back up your Grafana database so that you can roll back to a previous version, if required.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Back up Grafana",
        "Back up the Grafana database"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/back-up/back-up-grafana.md",
