      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "[Learn more about Grafana Enterprise](https://grafana.com/enterprise) and contact the Grafana Labs [Sales Team](https://grafana.com/contact?about=grafana-enterprise-stack) to purchase an Enterprise license. You can also obtain a trial license before the purchase.",
