      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana Loki is an open-source set of components that can be composed into a fully featured logging stack. For more information, refer to [Loki documentation](https://grafana.com/docs/loki/<LOKI_VERSION>/).",
