      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana Tempo is an open source, easy-to-use and high-volume distributed tracing backend. For more information, refer to [Tempo documentation](https://grafana.com/docs/tempo/<TEMPO_VERSION>/).",
