    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6437f468a3272af91f65",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **GitHub issues and pull requests**: Use for reproducible bugs in core Grafana and maintained plugins, small and actionable feature requests, and code or docs changes via pull requests. Avoid general “how do I” questions. For security issues, follow the [security policy](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/security/policy).",
