    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f70124e3903f14a3ec45",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Grafana community forums**: Use for questions, troubleshooting, best practices, plugin development Q&A, and early idea discussion. Forums create a searchable public knowledge base that helps others with the same problems and questions. Start here if you are unsure: [Grafana community forums](https://community.grafana.com/).",
