      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Grafana Community Slack**: Use for quick, time-sensitive chats and networking. Do not rely on Slack for long troubleshooting or decisions. Share outcomes back to a forum topic or GitHub issue/PR to keep a public record: [Grafana Community Slack](https://slack.grafana.com).",
