    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a9fe03850129b988ead4",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- `time` and `time.window` - Defines a time range from `time-time.window/2` to `time+time.window/2`. Both parameters should be specified in `ms`. For example `?time=1500000000000&time.window=10000` results in a 10-second time range from 1499999995000 to 1500000005000`.",
      "headingPath": [],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/dashboards/time-range-URLs.md",
