    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5ed48d2e761c78477662",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Forward OAuth identity**: Forwards the OAuth access token and the OIDC ID token, if available, of the user querying to the data source",
