    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c2f4374a1cf25cf089d8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Profiles, continuous profiling, and distributed traces are all tools that can be used to improve the performance and reliability of applications. However, each tool has its own strengths and weaknesses, and it is important to choose the right tool for the job as well as understand when to use both.",
      "headingPath": [],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/datasources/pyroscope-profile-tracing-intro.md",
