    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3d9d678e1194827f9293",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Use the **Data operations** drop-down to select a macro like `$__timeGroup` or `$__timeGroupAlias`. Select a time column from the **Column** drop-down and a time interval from the **Interval** drop-down to create a time-series query.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Macros"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/datasources/sql-query-builder-macros.md",
