    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4a42955a734ebe25ed4f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To use the TraceQL query editor in self-hosted Grafana 9.3.2 and older, you need to [enable the `traceqlEditor` feature toggle](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/feature-toggles/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/datasources/tempo-editor-traceql.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "003a449fd9604839ca39a071ca081b2985cca7ad",
        "sha256": "9c7845760d6acd3125be422446a3a81278de8126cebeba1e25349ed54ac6152a",
        "lineStart": 34,
        "lineEnd": 34,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/datasources/tempo-editor-traceql.md#L34-L34"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7adbc5ac9c6753a9691b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you're trying to query a self-managed Grafana Tempo or Grafana Enterprise Traces database with a gateway, such as nginx, in front of it from your hosted Grafana, that gateway (for example, nginx) must allow gRPC connections. If it doesn't, streaming won't work and queries will fail to return results.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin",
        "Streaming and gRPC"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/datasources/tempo-editor-traceql.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "003a449fd9604839ca39a071ca081b2985cca7ad",
        "sha256": "9c7845760d6acd3125be422446a3a81278de8126cebeba1e25349ed54ac6152a",
        "lineStart": 38,
        "lineEnd": 39,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/datasources/tempo-editor-traceql.md#L38-L39"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.97409228698cb690fdd9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you can't configure your gateway to allow gRPC, deactivate streaming in your hosted Grafana. In Grafana 11.2 and newer, you can deactivate the **Streaming** option in your Tempo data source settings from **Connections** > **Data sources** in the Grafana main menu. You can also open a support escalation to request streaming query results be disabled in your hosted Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin",
        "Streaming and gRPC"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/datasources/tempo-editor-traceql.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "003a449fd9604839ca39a071ca081b2985cca7ad",
        "sha256": "9c7845760d6acd3125be422446a3a81278de8126cebeba1e25349ed54ac6152a",
        "lineStart": 41,
        "lineEnd": 43,
