    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3c12568fde77ed05f8f9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Query results appear in a table, such as **Table - Traces**, under the query editor. Each span (and the trace it belongs to) matching the query conditions is returned by the query. If there are no filter conditions, all spans are matching and thus returned with their associated traces.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin",
        "View query results"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/datasources/tempo-editor-traceql.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "003a449fd9604839ca39a071ca081b2985cca7ad",
        "sha256": "9c7845760d6acd3125be422446a3a81278de8126cebeba1e25349ed54ac6152a",
        "lineStart": 112,
        "lineEnd": 114,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/datasources/tempo-editor-traceql.md#L112-L114"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bbf9da2c372a8e241379",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A query is performed against a defined time interval, relative (for example, the last 3 hours) or absolute (for example, from X date-time to Y date-time). The query response is also limited by the number of traces (**Limit**) and spans per spanset (**Span Limit**).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin",
        "View query results"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/datasources/tempo-editor-traceql.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "003a449fd9604839ca39a071ca081b2985cca7ad",
        "sha256": "9c7845760d6acd3125be422446a3a81278de8126cebeba1e25349ed54ac6152a",
