    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.79a32de09ffd0312c6b4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Under **Options**, you can choose to display the table as **Traces** or **Spans** focused.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin",
        "View query results",
        "Focus on traces or spans"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/datasources/tempo-editor-traceql.md",
