      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| 3      | Choose filter         | Choose one or more of the filters.                                                                                                                 | Optional. You can execute an empty query in the Search tab. In TraceQL, `{}` is a valid query and is the default query to provide a list of all traces or spans. |",
