      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ea1f10b79df12e4bc085",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Equals (`=`) or other non-regular expression operators: Each value becomes a separate condition joined with `||` inside parentheses. For the not-equals (`!=`) operator, conditions are joined with `&&` instead.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Write TraceQL queries using Search",
        "Define filters"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/datasources/tempo-search-traceql.md",
