      "sourceText": "Queries can take a little while to return results. The results appear in a table underneath the query builder. Selecting a Trace ID (2 in the screenshot) displays more detailed information (3 in the screenshot). **Span Filters** (4 in the screenshot) provide an additional to refine the query results.",
