    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.09c3f7d2ba284c152e16",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. **Profiling**: A Pyroscope SDK or Grafana Alloy sending profiling data to Pyroscope. Refer to [Configure the client to send profiles](/docs/pyroscope/<PYROSCOPE_VERSION>/configure-client/) for setup instructions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/datasources/tempo-traces-to-profiles.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "6dc46f7fa57afe9c4e233df58e02758490cd6772",
