      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3ace60aa34e031c955e9",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. **Span profiling bridge**: A language-specific OpenTelemetry integration package that links profiling data with trace spans. Without this package, traces and profiles are independent signals with no connection between them. Refer to [Link tracing and profiling with span profiles](/docs/pyroscope/<PYROSCOPE_VERSION>/configure-client/trace-span-profiles/) for per-language setup instructions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/datasources/tempo-traces-to-profiles.md",
