    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ac4dc1e48821d7e94965",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Every plugin you create will require at least two files: `plugin.json` and `src/module.ts`.",
      "headingPath": [],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/tutorials/plugin-anatomy.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "67f04f76bc39532e5a5cf5311d45e23e2ff36ab9",
        "sha256": "6e6185a9a68a8bc8bdbfbba559912a40bbc9dd1b3c5bde6d72725f6cd2ced9d6",
        "lineStart": 11,
        "lineEnd": 11,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/tutorials/plugin-anatomy.md#L11-L11"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ad477bfc9fe0c9a292e9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When Grafana starts, it scans the plugin directory for any subdirectory that contains a `plugin.json` file. The `plugin.json` file contains information about your plugin, and tells Grafana about what capabilities and dependencies your plugin needs.",
      "headingPath": [
        "plugin.json"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/tutorials/plugin-anatomy.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "67f04f76bc39532e5a5cf5311d45e23e2ff36ab9",
        "sha256": "6e6185a9a68a8bc8bdbfbba559912a40bbc9dd1b3c5bde6d72725f6cd2ced9d6",
        "lineStart": 15,
        "lineEnd": 15,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/tutorials/plugin-anatomy.md#L15-L15"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5fcf93621c31a9b0b1c8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "While certain plugin types can have specific configuration options, let's look at the mandatory ones:",
      "headingPath": [
        "plugin.json"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/tutorials/plugin-anatomy.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "67f04f76bc39532e5a5cf5311d45e23e2ff36ab9",
        "sha256": "6e6185a9a68a8bc8bdbfbba559912a40bbc9dd1b3c5bde6d72725f6cd2ced9d6",
        "lineStart": 17,
        "lineEnd": 17,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/tutorials/plugin-anatomy.md#L17-L17"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4998b59674e163636d29",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- `type` tells Grafana what type of plugin to expect. Grafana supports three types of plugins: `panel`, `datasource`, and `app`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "plugin.json"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/tutorials/plugin-anatomy.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "67f04f76bc39532e5a5cf5311d45e23e2ff36ab9",
