    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9097d0ce97f1c8445e46",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Symlog** - Use a symmetrical logarithmic scale. When you select this option, a list appears for you to choose a binary (base 2) or common (base 10) logarithmic scale. The linear threshold option allows you to set the threshold at which the scale changes from linear to logarithmic.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Placement",
        "Scale"
      ],
      "source": {
