      "sourceText": "To define hard limits of the y-axis, set standard min/max options. For more information, refer to [Configure standard options](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/panels-visualizations/configure-standard-options/#max). The following examples shows how this option works in a time series visualization:",
