        "lineStart": 11,
        "lineEnd": 11,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/visualizations/legend-options-1.md#L11-L11"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4e8c40a038331601e90a",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Visibility | Toggle the switch to turn the legend on or off.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |",
      "headingPath": [],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/visualizations/legend-options-1.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "720bd14c9b69e169768c69fb210c93bc2241ca44",
        "sha256": "31e555efad0e1b96a7c1b3ec39bd58ac9a3aad19d2a30f792bba0bf1b2c2907a",
        "lineStart": 13,
        "lineEnd": 13,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/visualizations/legend-options-1.md#L13-L13"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4ffc5ced7dc11b3f57a2",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Mode       | Use these settings to define how the legend appears in your visualization. **List** displays the legend as a list. This is a default display mode of the legend. **Table** displays the legend as a table.                                                                                                                                         |",
      "headingPath": [],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/visualizations/legend-options-1.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "720bd14c9b69e169768c69fb210c93bc2241ca44",
        "sha256": "31e555efad0e1b96a7c1b3ec39bd58ac9a3aad19d2a30f792bba0bf1b2c2907a",
        "lineStart": 14,
        "lineEnd": 14,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/visualizations/legend-options-1.md#L14-L14"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4b4c1f551be190413713",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Placement  | Choose where to display the legend. **Bottom** places the legend below the graph. **Right** places the legend to the right of the graph.                                                                                                                                                                                                           |",
      "headingPath": [],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/visualizations/legend-options-1.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "720bd14c9b69e169768c69fb210c93bc2241ca44",
        "sha256": "31e555efad0e1b96a7c1b3ec39bd58ac9a3aad19d2a30f792bba0bf1b2c2907a",
        "lineStart": 15,
        "lineEnd": 15,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/visualizations/legend-options-1.md#L15-L15"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9d392c93c194a70dfba7",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Width      | Control how wide the legend is when placed on the right side of the visualization. The value may be a basic pixel width or a more complex [CSS width property](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/width) such as `max(200px, 20%)`. This option is only displayed if you set the legend placement to **Right**. |",
      "headingPath": [],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/visualizations/legend-options-1.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "720bd14c9b69e169768c69fb210c93bc2241ca44",
        "sha256": "31e555efad0e1b96a7c1b3ec39bd58ac9a3aad19d2a30f792bba0bf1b2c2907a",
        "lineStart": 16,
        "lineEnd": 16,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/visualizations/legend-options-1.md#L16-L16"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5bfdca8cdf9d25628681",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Limit      | Limit how many series items are shown by default. The rest become expandable using a **Show all** link.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |",
      "headingPath": [],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/visualizations/legend-options-1.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "720bd14c9b69e169768c69fb210c93bc2241ca44",
        "sha256": "31e555efad0e1b96a7c1b3ec39bd58ac9a3aad19d2a30f792bba0bf1b2c2907a",
        "lineStart": 17,
        "lineEnd": 17,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/visualizations/legend-options-1.md#L17-L17"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6985b3ffb459d93337cc",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Values     | Choose which of the [standard calculations](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/calculation-types/) to show in the legend. You can have more than one.                                                                                                                                   |",
      "headingPath": [],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/visualizations/legend-options-1.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "720bd14c9b69e169768c69fb210c93bc2241ca44",
        "sha256": "31e555efad0e1b96a7c1b3ec39bd58ac9a3aad19d2a30f792bba0bf1b2c2907a",
        "lineStart": 18,
        "lineEnd": 18,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/visualizations/legend-options-1.md#L18-L18"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.26bf1a560bc748def497",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Overflow   | Control how overflow for long series names is handled. **Ellipsis** truncates the series names with \"...\" at the end. **Wrap** word-wraps the series names to multiple lines. This option is only displayed if you set the legend placement to **Right** and mode is **Table**.                                                                    |",
      "headingPath": [],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/shared/visualizations/legend-options-1.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "720bd14c9b69e169768c69fb210c93bc2241ca44",
        "sha256": "31e555efad0e1b96a7c1b3ec39bd58ac9a3aad19d2a30f792bba0bf1b2c2907a",
        "lineStart": 19,
        "lineEnd": 19,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/shared/visualizations/legend-options-1.md#L19-L19"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e77d61b1eef550a50b57",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When the legend option is enabled it can show either the value mappings or the threshold brackets. To show the value mappings in the legend, it's important that the **Color scheme** as referenced in [Color scheme](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/panels-visualizations/configure-standard-options/#color-scheme) is set to **Single color** or **Classic palette**. To see the threshold brackets in the legend set the **Color scheme** to **From thresholds**.",
      "headingPath": [],
      "source": {
