      "id": "grafana.candidate.bccb61aadb9d1be2596c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Control how overflow for long series names is handled. This option is only displayed if you set the legend placement to **Right** and mode is **Table**.",
