      "id": "grafana.candidate.5ad02348646c55bb4a56",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you encounter an error or problem, then you can check the Grafana server log. Usually located at `/var/log/grafana/grafana.log` on Unix systems or in `<grafana_install_dir>/data/log` on other platforms and manual installations.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshooting",
        "Troubleshoot with logs"
