    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.78e12da5c4e268786155",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "On-demand data source diagnostics is an [experimental](https://grafana.com/docs/release-life-cycle/#experimental) feature that helps you share troubleshooting evidence with Grafana Labs Technical Support. The feature is disabled by default. To switch it on, refer to [Enable the feature toggle](#enable-the-feature-toggle).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Generate a data source diagnostic bundle"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "71d7487f37cac3bf9f5110f1ad1851bb422e5d23",
        "sha256": "10ff5aefbde9d04ff889df9d370654a8bc798e11efc768dce9d4a319fc43270d",
        "lineStart": 21,
        "lineEnd": 21,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md#L21-L21"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6298ad834cafd3e4ef83",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When a panel returns an error, no data, or data that looks wrong, Grafana Labs Technical Support needs to know what your data source actually returned. In Grafana Cloud, you can grant support access to your stack so an engineer can investigate live. A self-managed instance isn't reachable by support, so you collect the evidence yourself in a diagnostic bundle and send it in.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Generate a data source diagnostic bundle"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "71d7487f37cac3bf9f5110f1ad1851bb422e5d23",
        "sha256": "10ff5aefbde9d04ff889df9d370654a8bc798e11efc768dce9d4a319fc43270d",
        "lineStart": 24,
        "lineEnd": 24,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md#L24-L24"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e87f7f607959fad1c384",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you generate a diagnostic bundle, Grafana re-runs the panel's queries with traffic capture active and packages the result as a single `.tar.gz` file containing the requests and responses exchanged with your data source, the data the data source plugin returned to Grafana, the panel and dashboard configuration, and metadata about the capture.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Generate a data source diagnostic bundle"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "71d7487f37cac3bf9f5110f1ad1851bb422e5d23",
        "sha256": "10ff5aefbde9d04ff889df9d370654a8bc798e11efc768dce9d4a319fc43270d",
        "lineStart": 26,
        "lineEnd": 26,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md#L26-L26"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1191a6429f354140e341",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A diagnostic bundle records upstream traffic and error messages verbatim, without redaction. Request headers, query parameters, request and response bodies, and error text are all stored as they occurred, so a bundle can contain authentication tokens, passwords, and the contents of the data your queries returned.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Generate a data source diagnostic bundle"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "71d7487f37cac3bf9f5110f1ad1851bb422e5d23",
        "sha256": "10ff5aefbde9d04ff889df9d370654a8bc798e11efc768dce9d4a319fc43270d",
        "lineStart": 29,
        "lineEnd": 29,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md#L29-L29"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c30e00f07e2fb841c499",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Treat a bundle as you would treat a credential. **Review it before you share it**, and **send it only to Grafana Labs Technical Support**, through your Grafana Labs support ticket.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Generate a data source diagnostic bundle"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "71d7487f37cac3bf9f5110f1ad1851bb422e5d23",
