      "sourceText": "The `grafana.onDemandDiagnostics` feature toggle is disabled by default. While it's disabled, Grafana hides the diagnostics UI elements and the underlying endpoints return `404`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Generate a data source diagnostic bundle",
        "Before you begin",
        "Enable the feature toggle"
      ],
