      "sourceText": "| `traffic.har`         | The HTTP requests and responses exchanged with the data source, in [HAR 1.2](http://www.softwareishard.com/blog/har-12-spec/) format, including bodies and timings. Connection failures are recorded as an entry with a comment. Not available for every data source; refer to [Data source support for capturing upstream traffic](#data-source-support-for-capturing-upstream-traffic). |",
