    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.60042375366264a2435c",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **SQL and other database data sources**, such as MySQL, PostgreSQL, Microsoft SQL Server, and MongoDB. These communicate over a database wire protocol instead of HTTP, so there's no HTTP exchange to record.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Generate a data source diagnostic bundle",
        "Data source support for capturing upstream traffic",
        "Data sources that don't capture upstream traffic"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "71d7487f37cac3bf9f5110f1ad1851bb422e5d23",
        "sha256": "10ff5aefbde9d04ff889df9d370654a8bc798e11efc768dce9d4a319fc43270d",
        "lineStart": 123,
        "lineEnd": 123,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md#L123-L123"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ea2c84f2a4023a7a0fd2",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Amazon CloudWatch.** Queries go through the AWS SDK, which doesn't use the instrumented HTTP client that capture depends on.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Generate a data source diagnostic bundle",
        "Data source support for capturing upstream traffic",
        "Data sources that don't capture upstream traffic"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "71d7487f37cac3bf9f5110f1ad1851bb422e5d23",
        "sha256": "10ff5aefbde9d04ff889df9d370654a8bc798e11efc768dce9d4a319fc43270d",
        "lineStart": 124,
        "lineEnd": 124,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md#L124-L124"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f0068ce7dfb50087e62f",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Grafana re-runs your queries.** A bundle reflects a fresh execution at the moment you generate it, not the original failure, and it bypasses the query cache. An intermittent failure might not reproduce, so a healthy-looking bundle doesn't prove the problem is resolved.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Generate a data source diagnostic bundle",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "71d7487f37cac3bf9f5110f1ad1851bb422e5d23",
        "sha256": "10ff5aefbde9d04ff889df9d370654a8bc798e11efc768dce9d4a319fc43270d",
        "lineStart": 130,
        "lineEnd": 130,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md#L130-L130"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9dab6032d7e271e60d23",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Queries run as you.** Because you generate the bundle as a server administrator, failures that depend on the affected user's identity might not reproduce. Examples include per-user OAuth forwarding and row-level database permissions. If a specific user is affected, note that in your ticket.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Generate a data source diagnostic bundle",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "71d7487f37cac3bf9f5110f1ad1851bb422e5d23",
        "sha256": "10ff5aefbde9d04ff889df9d370654a8bc798e11efc768dce9d4a319fc43270d",
        "lineStart": 132,
        "lineEnd": 132,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md#L132-L132"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4965fa08de5189eb94bf",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- A bundle captures panel and dashboard queries only. Failures in the variable picker, in a data source's **Save & test** button, in annotation queries, or during alert rule evaluation don't appear.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Generate a data source diagnostic bundle",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "71d7487f37cac3bf9f5110f1ad1851bb422e5d23",
        "sha256": "10ff5aefbde9d04ff889df9d370654a8bc798e11efc768dce9d4a319fc43270d",
        "lineStart": 134,
        "lineEnd": 134,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md#L134-L134"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c80ab8491fcadbfc84ab",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Server-side expressions and panel transformations are recorded in `panel.json` as configuration, not as the data that flows between them. So if `querydata.json` looks correct but the panel doesn't, check that configuration.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Generate a data source diagnostic bundle",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "71d7487f37cac3bf9f5110f1ad1851bb422e5d23",
        "sha256": "10ff5aefbde9d04ff889df9d370654a8bc798e11efc768dce9d4a319fc43270d",
        "lineStart": 136,
        "lineEnd": 136,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md#L136-L136"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f2ce844fd285ee6b9ac4",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Large responses might be trimmed**, and less commonly, generation fails outright. The following limits apply:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Generate a data source diagnostic bundle",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "71d7487f37cac3bf9f5110f1ad1851bb422e5d23",
        "sha256": "10ff5aefbde9d04ff889df9d370654a8bc798e11efc768dce9d4a319fc43270d",
        "lineStart": 138,
        "lineEnd": 138,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md#L138-L138"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.40e1127506eed11c43fb",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- `querydata.json` is capped at 1 GiB for a single panel and 1.5 GiB across a whole-dashboard bundle. A response over that limit is replaced by a summary that records what was left out, and the rest of the bundle still generates. For a dashboard bundle, once the shared 1.5 GiB budget is used up, the remaining panels' query data is skipped, and the reason is recorded in `manifest.json`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Generate a data source diagnostic bundle",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "71d7487f37cac3bf9f5110f1ad1851bb422e5d23",
        "sha256": "10ff5aefbde9d04ff889df9d370654a8bc798e11efc768dce9d4a319fc43270d",
        "lineStart": 139,
        "lineEnd": 139,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md#L139-L139"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3ba5fe15cc7cc7d96e9c",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- `traffic.har` is limited to 64 MiB per request or response body and 256 MiB of retained traffic per panel. A body over the per-body limit is kept as a truncated prefix, and its entry reports `bodySize: -1` with the actual size in `content.size`. When a panel's traffic exceeds the per-panel limit, further entries keep their headers, sizes, and timings but omit the body text.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Generate a data source diagnostic bundle",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "71d7487f37cac3bf9f5110f1ad1851bb422e5d23",
        "sha256": "10ff5aefbde9d04ff889df9d370654a8bc798e11efc768dce9d4a319fc43270d",
        "lineStart": 140,
        "lineEnd": 140,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md#L140-L140"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f5990b8c02923e25ce0c",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Generating a bundle can fail outright, instead of trimming, when the entire request to Grafana exceeds 100 MiB. That request includes the queries, the panel and dashboard JSON, and, for a single panel, the frames your browser is holding. This is uncommon, because it requires an unusually large payload from the browser itself—which a large data source response alone doesn't produce.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Generate a data source diagnostic bundle",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "71d7487f37cac3bf9f5110f1ad1851bb422e5d23",
        "sha256": "10ff5aefbde9d04ff889df9d370654a8bc798e11efc768dce9d4a319fc43270d",
        "lineStart": 141,
        "lineEnd": 141,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/troubleshooting/generate-diagnostic-bundle/index.md#L141-L141"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c8221ec1566fbd734f69",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you hit one of these limits, or a bundle takes an unreasonably long time to generate, reproduce the problem on a minimal setup instead of the original dashboard:",
      "headingPath": [
