      "id": "grafana.candidate.de882e427c49d6c57302",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. In **Folder**, click **+ New folder** and enter a name. For example: `web-traffic-alerts` . This folder contains our alert rules.",
