      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "These [types of labels](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/annotation-label/#label-types) are generated by the data source query and they can be leveraged to match our notification policies without needing to manually add them to the alert rule.",
