    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7f1540815a73e47c8603",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Now that the alert rule has been configured, you should receive alert [notifications](http://grafana.com/docs/grafana/next/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rule-evaluation/state-and-health/#notifications) in the contact point whenever the alert triggers and gets resolved. In our example, each alert instance should be routed separately as we configured labels to match notification policies. Once the evaluation interval has concluded (1m), you should receive an alert notification in the Webhook endpoint.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up the Grafana stack",
        "Receive alert notifications"
      ],
