      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The alert notification details show that the alert instance corresponding to the website views from desktop devices was correctly routed through the notification policy to the Webhook contact point. The notification also shows that the instance is in **Firing** state, as well as it includes the label `device=desktop`, which makes the routing of the alert instance possible.",
