      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana includes a [test data source](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/datasources/testdata/) that creates simulated time series data. This data source is included in the demo environment for this tutorial. If you're working in Grafana Cloud or your own local Grafana instance, you can add the data source through the **Connections** menu.",
