    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f4d6734de6bf4aba861a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Now that the alert rules have been configured, you should receive alert notifications in the contact point(s) whenever alerts trigger.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up the Grafana stack",
        "Receiving grouped alert notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/alerting-get-started-pt3/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "20141eee062888fed651ddcfe93be449bb31f7fa",
        "sha256": "9d14923e95d9842c88d10c01e4602b74ae99db9107ea2828afb28a7f7a9886e5",
        "lineStart": 423,
        "lineEnd": 423,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/tutorials/alerting-get-started-pt3/index.md#L423-L423"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c8b28177ef1e97d7dd65",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When the configured alert rule detects CPU or memory usage higher than 75% across multiple regions, it will evaluate the metric every minute. If the condition persists, notifications will be grouped together, with a Group wait of 30 seconds before the first alert is sent. Follow-up notifications for the same alert group will be sent at intervals of 2 minutes (US-west alert instances only), increasing the frequency of the grouped alert notifications. US-east instances follow-up notifications should be sent at the default interval of 5 minutes. If the condition continues for an extended period, a Repeat interval of 4 hours ensures that the alert is only resent if the issue persists.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up the Grafana stack",
        "Receiving grouped alert notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/alerting-get-started-pt3/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "20141eee062888fed651ddcfe93be449bb31f7fa",
        "sha256": "9d14923e95d9842c88d10c01e4602b74ae99db9107ea2828afb28a7f7a9886e5",
        "lineStart": 425,
        "lineEnd": 425,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/tutorials/alerting-get-started-pt3/index.md#L425-L425"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5ca512528717f699f6ab",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "As a result, our notification policies should route three notifications: one grouped notification grouping both CPU and memory alert instances from the us-west region and two separate notifications with alert instances from the us-east region.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up the Grafana stack",
        "Receiving grouped alert notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/alerting-get-started-pt3/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "20141eee062888fed651ddcfe93be449bb31f7fa",
        "sha256": "9d14923e95d9842c88d10c01e4602b74ae99db9107ea2828afb28a7f7a9886e5",
        "lineStart": 427,
        "lineEnd": 427,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/tutorials/alerting-get-started-pt3/index.md#L427-L427"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ad918bc7e673a4d68a49",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By configuring **notification policies** and using **labels** (such as _region_), you can group alert notifications based on specific criteria and route them to the appropriate teams. Fine-tuning **timing options**—including group wait, group interval, and repeat interval—further can reduce noise and ensures notifications remain actionable without overwhelming on-call engineers.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up the Grafana stack",
        "Conclusion"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/alerting-get-started-pt3/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "20141eee062888fed651ddcfe93be449bb31f7fa",
        "sha256": "9d14923e95d9842c88d10c01e4602b74ae99db9107ea2828afb28a7f7a9886e5",
        "lineStart": 497,
