      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Now that the template has been applied to the contact point, you should receive notifications in the specified contact point.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up the Grafana stack",
        "Step 2: Template notifications",
        "Receiving notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/alerting-get-started-pt4/index.md",
