    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8d926d0c3b897ee9efbe",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In this tutorial, we learned how to use templating in Grafana Alerting to create dynamic and actionable alert notifications. We explored how to configure alert rules with annotations, design custom notification templates, and apply them to contact points to enhance the clarity and efficiency of alert messages. By organizing alert instances into concise notifications, you can reduce noise and ensure on-call engineers quickly understand and address critical issues.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Set up the Grafana stack",
        "Conclusion"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/alerting-get-started-pt4/index.md",
