      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Leverage notification policies for **dynamic routing based on query values**: Use notification policies to route alerts based on dynamically generated labels, in a way that critical alerts reach the on-call team and less urgent ones go to a general monitoring channel.",
