    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3f7a2c59efc044c90c49",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In this use case, we focus on monitoring the system's CPU, memory, and disk usage as part of a monitoring setup. This example is based on the [Grafana Prometheus Alerting Demo](https://github.com/tonypowa/grafana-prometheus-alerting-demo), which collects and visualizes system metrics via Prometheus and Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
