      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d27e82c6a6e7295bff42",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Finally, you should receive notifications at the contact point associated with either `prod` or `staging`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin",
        "Done! Your alerts are now dynamically routed"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/alerting-get-started-pt5/index.md",
