    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5d1c2f3b418714cb0687",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To keep track of these metrics you can set up a visualization for CPU usage and memory consumption. This will make it easier to see how the system is performing.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin",
        "Step 1: Create a visualization to monitor metrics"
      ],
      "source": {
