    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3c8a8f432d9cdd5bbe03",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In this step, we set up a new contact point. This contact point uses the [webhook integration](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/alerting/configure-notifications/manage-contact-points/integrations/webhook-notifier/). In order to make this work, we also need an endpoint for our webhook integration to receive the alert. We can use [Webhook.site](https://webhook.site/) to quickly set up that test endpoint. This way we can make sure that our alert is actually sending a notification somewhere.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Before you begin",
        "Create a contact point"
      ],
