      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Next, we establish an [alert rule](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/alerting/alerting-rules/create-grafana-managed-rule/) within Grafana Alerting to notify us whenever alert rules are triggered and resolved.",
