      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Now that the alert rule has been configured, you should receive alert [notifications](http://grafana.com/docs/grafana/next/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rule-evaluation/state-and-health/#notifications) in the contact point whenever alerts trigger and get resolved.",
