    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5e79a796412d3cef1e76",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In [Grafana Alerting: Multi-dimensional alerts and how to route them](http://www.grafana.com/tutorials/alerting-get-started-pt2/) you'll learn to use alert instances and route notifications by labels to contacts.",
