    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.aecdd1274b57ffd2b28c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For InfluxDB, you will always create a [Grafana managed rule](/docs/grafana/latest/alerting/alerting-rules/create-grafana-managed-rule/#add-grafana-managed-rule).",
      "headingPath": [
        "How to create Grafana alerts with InfluxDB and the Flux query language",
