    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.aed8b6bd6dd4e88dd80d",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Let's begin by examining a typical query and the resulting time graph for our hourly data across a 7-day period. A query like this is shown below:",
      "headingPath": [
