      "id": "grafana.candidate.c7aef58164627058f3a9",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Now let's adjust our query to calculate daily usage. With many datasources, this can be a rather complex operation. But with Flux, by simply changing the aggregateWindow function parameters we can calculate the daily usage over the same 7-day period:",
