      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "We begin, as always, by writing our initial query. This is very similar to our query in example 1, but note how our third `filter()` function captures the data from all five tanks and not just `A5`:",
      "headingPath": [
