    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f3a3251eae4288f002eb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "💡Tip: If the tanks were shut down every night from 23:00 to 07:00, they would possibly fall below the 30 °C threshold. If one did not want to receive alerts during those hours, one can use the Flux function hourSelection() which filters rows by time values in a specified hour range.",
