      "id": "grafana.candidate.b6a75476049a263c9dfe",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "With multidimensional alerts we can avoid repeating ourselves. But what if the scenario were even more complex? In the next and final example, we will examine how to use multidimensional alerts to create the most dynamic alerts possible.",
