      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "An [evaluation group](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/alerting/fundamentals/alert-rules/rule-evaluation/) defines when an alert rule fires, and it’s based on two settings:",
