    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a711784225237b25ff79",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can also configure Grafana to allow [anonymous access](/docs/grafana/latest/auth/overview/#anonymous-authentication), to make dashboards available even to those who don't have a Grafana user account. That's how Grafana Labs made https://play.grafana.org publicly available.",
