      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Graphona has asked you to add a group of early adopters that work in the Marketing and Engineering teams. They'll need to be able to edit their own team's dashboards, but want to have view access to dashboards that belong to the other team.",
