    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3b6ada6ac49572aa7d5e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Marketing team is going to use Grafana for analytics, while the Engineering team wants to monitor the application they're building.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Introduction",
        "Manage resource access with folders",
        "Exercise"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/create-users-and-teams/index.md",
