      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Add the [`rate`](https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/querying/functions/#rate) function to your query to visualize the rate of requests per second. Enter the following in the query editor and then press Shift + Enter.",
