      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Manually annotating your dashboard is fine for those single events. For regularly occurring events, such as deploying a new release, Grafana supports querying annotations from one of your data sources. Let's create an annotation using the Loki data source we added earlier.",
