    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1662fd8252539947a5b7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Annotations also work very well alongside alert rules. In the next and final section, we set up an alert rules for our app `grafana.news` and then we trigger it. This provides a quick intro to our new Alerting platform.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Introduction",
        "Annotate events",
        "Using annotations to correlate logs with metrics"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/grafana-fundamentals/index.md",
