    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.22aa8c5b538f754a3777",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Alert rules allow you to identify problems in your system moments after they occur. By quickly identifying unintended changes in your system, you can minimize disruptions to your services.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Introduction",
        "Create a Grafana-managed alert rule"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/grafana-fundamentals/index.md",
