    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c08c1087411ceb326901",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana's new alerting platform debuted with Grafana 8. A year later, with Grafana 9, it became the default alerting method. In this step we create a Grafana-managed alert rule. Then we trigger our new alert rule and send a test message to a dummy endpoint.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Introduction",
        "Create a Grafana-managed alert rule"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/grafana-fundamentals/index.md",
