    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.35c20b56f3d9f003f383",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. A _Contact point_ - A Contact point defines how Grafana delivers an alert instance. When the conditions of an _alert rule_ are met, Grafana notifies the contact points, or channels, configured for that alert rule.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Introduction",
        "Create a Grafana-managed alert rule"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/grafana-fundamentals/index.md",
