      "id": "grafana.candidate.c395f992cb304440f865",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. An _Alert rule_ - An Alert rule defines one or more _conditions_ that Grafana regularly evaluates. When these evaluations meet the rule's criteria, the alert rule is triggered.",
