      "sourceText": "In this step, we set up a new contact point. This contact point uses the _webhooks_ channel. In order to make this work, we also need an endpoint for our webhook channel to receive the alert notification. We can use [Webhook.site](https://webhook.site/) to quickly set up that test endpoint. This way we can make sure that our alert manager is actually sending a notification somewhere.",
