      "sourceText": "Once the query `sum(rate(tns_request_duration_seconds_count[5m])) by(route)` returns a value greater than `0.2` Grafana triggers our alert rule. Browse to the webhook endpoint we created earlier and find the sent Grafana alert notification with details and metadata.",
