      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Rewrite URL should contain the capture group from the pattern matching that returns the part of the URL after the subpath. The pattern used above returns three capture groups and the third one {R:2} returns the part of the URL after `http://yourdomain.com:8080/grafana/`.",
