    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.85bb9752781ba5d474aa",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For this tutorial, you'll configure your Raspberry Pi to be _headless_. This means you don't need to connect a monitor, keyboard, or mouse to your Raspberry Pi. All configuration is done from your regular computer.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Introduction",
        "Set up your Raspberry Pi"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/install-grafana-on-raspberry-pi/index.md",
