      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. From the list, select **Raspberry Pi OS (other)** and then select **Raspberry Pi OS Lite**, which is a Debian-based operating system for the Raspberry Pi. Since you're going to run a headless Raspberry Pi, you won't need the desktop dependencies.",
