      "id": "grafana.candidate.51706d1e7b0b7bbc81ef",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This guide shows you how to install and configure the [Hubot-Grafana](https://github.com/stephenyeargin/hubot-grafana) plugin. This plugin allows you to tell Hubot to render any dashboard or graph right from a channel in Slack, Basecamp, or any other supported Hubot adapter. The bot will respond with an image of the graph and a link that will take you to the graph.",
      "headingPath": [
