      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "[Hubot](https://hubot.github.com/) is an universal and extensible chat bot that can be used with many chat services and has a huge library of third party plugins that allow you to automate anything from your chat rooms.",
