    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.85f712f534c1ad3bd458",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Hubot-Grafana plugin requires two environment variables to be set in order to work properly.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Integrate Hubot with Grafana",
        "Configure"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/integrate-hubot/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "35299df80b60d73cfbff5065346433fa542c70e5",
        "sha256": "71fd57052b0d9776fd07a9d1fcbd9d9c1cfa5397cbade3046c1b0a9ec38723b9",
        "lineStart": 56,
        "lineEnd": 56,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/tutorials/integrate-hubot/index.md#L56-L56"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.44fe1e916d3445952abe",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "There are [additional environment variables](https://github.com/stephenyeargin/hubot-grafana?tab=readme-ov-file#general-settings) that you can set to control the appearance of the graphs.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Integrate Hubot with Grafana",
        "Configure"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/integrate-hubot/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "35299df80b60d73cfbff5065346433fa542c70e5",
        "sha256": "71fd57052b0d9776fd07a9d1fcbd9d9c1cfa5397cbade3046c1b0a9ec38723b9",
        "lineStart": 63,
        "lineEnd": 63,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/tutorials/integrate-hubot/index.md#L63-L63"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.19e9a298fc6bc1b3c134",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The hubot plugin will take advantage of the Grafana server side rendering feature that can render any panel on the server using phantomjs. Grafana ships with a phantomjs binary (Linux only).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Integrate Hubot with Grafana",
        "Configure",
        "Grafana server side rendering"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/integrate-hubot/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "35299df80b60d73cfbff5065346433fa542c70e5",
        "sha256": "71fd57052b0d9776fd07a9d1fcbd9d9c1cfa5397cbade3046c1b0a9ec38723b9",
        "lineStart": 67,
        "lineEnd": 67,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/tutorials/integrate-hubot/index.md#L67-L67"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e44202170d50b9800a5e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To verify that this feature works try the `Direct link to rendered image` link in the panel share dialog. If you do not get an image when opening this link verify that the required font packages are installed for phantomjs to work.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Integrate Hubot with Grafana",
        "Configure",
        "Grafana server side rendering"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/integrate-hubot/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "35299df80b60d73cfbff5065346433fa542c70e5",
        "sha256": "71fd57052b0d9776fd07a9d1fcbd9d9c1cfa5397cbade3046c1b0a9ec38723b9",
        "lineStart": 69,
        "lineEnd": 69,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/tutorials/integrate-hubot/index.md#L69-L69"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.75f9956d2947ee75ae5d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You need to set the environment variable `HUBOT_GRAFANA_API_KEY` to a Grafana API Key. You can add these from the API Keys page which you find in the Organization dropdown.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Integrate Hubot with Grafana",
        "Configure",
        "Grafana API Key"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/integrate-hubot/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "35299df80b60d73cfbff5065346433fa542c70e5",
        "sha256": "71fd57052b0d9776fd07a9d1fcbd9d9c1cfa5397cbade3046c1b0a9ec38723b9",
        "lineStart": 75,
        "lineEnd": 75,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/tutorials/integrate-hubot/index.md#L75-L75"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5cb8fedc73cef1c91854",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "There are several approaches to uploading the rendered graphs. If you are using Slack, Rocket.Chat, or Telegram, the adapter's native uploader will take care of sending it through their respective API. If your Hubot is hosted on a platform that doesn't support uploads (such as IRC), you can use the [built-in S3 uploader](https://github.com/stephenyeargin/hubot-grafana/wiki/Amazon-S3-Image-Hosting). Note if you configure S3, it will not use the adapter's upload features.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Integrate Hubot with Grafana",
        "Configure",
        "Image uploading"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/integrate-hubot/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "35299df80b60d73cfbff5065346433fa542c70e5",
        "sha256": "71fd57052b0d9776fd07a9d1fcbd9d9c1cfa5397cbade3046c1b0a9ec38723b9",
        "lineStart": 79,
