    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fc129424f835db1a5be4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana is going to ship with integrated Slack and Hipchat features some day but you do not have to wait for that. Grafana 2 shipped with a very clever server side rendering feature that can render any panel to a png using phantomjs. The hubot plugin for Grafana is something you can install and use today!",
      "headingPath": [
        "Integrate Hubot with Grafana",
        "Summary"
      ],
      "source": {
