      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4f68570bdaad5fdf0d72",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana supports configuration as code through _provisioning_. The resources that currently supports provisioning are:",
