    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.710da747ebd46c64bc00",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Before you can start provisioning resources, Grafana needs to know where to find the _provisioning directory_. The provisioning directory contains configuration files that are applied whenever Grafana starts and continuously updated while running.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Introduction",
        "Set the provisioning directory"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/provision-dashboards-and-data-sources/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0dfc09eadb6c15b140a27ba0f790c01aebc1bce2",
        "sha256": "6aa77df0c0a5cf00f531e6ad4d5265d2df3b88d40861288670242302195edb66",
        "lineStart": 50,
        "lineEnd": 50,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/tutorials/provision-dashboards-and-data-sources/index.md#L50-L50"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fb696e9f12ce4dddb883",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, Grafana looks for a provisioning directory in the configuration directory (grafana > conf) on the system where Grafana is installed. However, if you are a Grafana Administrator, then you might want to place the config files in a shared resource like a network folder, so you would need to change the path to the provisioning directory.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Introduction",
        "Set the provisioning directory"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/provision-dashboards-and-data-sources/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0dfc09eadb6c15b140a27ba0f790c01aebc1bce2",
        "sha256": "6aa77df0c0a5cf00f531e6ad4d5265d2df3b88d40861288670242302195edb66",
        "lineStart": 52,
        "lineEnd": 52,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/tutorials/provision-dashboards-and-data-sources/index.md#L52-L52"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a6d296b20fb5931710f7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can set a different path by setting the `paths.provisioning` property in the main config file:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Introduction",
        "Set the provisioning directory"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/provision-dashboards-and-data-sources/index.md",
