    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d7c7dd674fb2ede569a0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For Grafana Live which uses WebSocket connections you may have to raise the nginx value for [`worker_connections`](https://nginx.org/en/docs/ngx_core_module.html#worker_connections) option which is `512` by default. The default value limits the number of possible concurrent connections with Grafana Live.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Introduction",
        "Configure reverse proxy",
        "Configure nginx"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/run-grafana-behind-a-proxy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b1ea811531ae6e815c3d6ec9a28516c9435affa8",
        "sha256": "94e43b955137ac2d61d664709e09902bef58100e672e968916f32f9720523bdb",
        "lineStart": 80,
        "lineEnd": 80,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/tutorials/run-grafana-behind-a-proxy/index.md#L80-L80"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f3cbd82d80ce73c025ad",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Also, be aware that the preceding configuration only works when the `proxy_pass` value for `location /` is a literal string. If you want to use a variable here, you must instead use [a rewrite rule](https://www.nginx.com/blog/creating-nginx-rewrite-rules/). For more information, refer to [the GitHub issue #18299](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/issues/18299).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Introduction",
        "Configure reverse proxy",
        "Configure nginx"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/run-grafana-behind-a-proxy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b1ea811531ae6e815c3d6ec9a28516c9435affa8",
        "sha256": "94e43b955137ac2d61d664709e09902bef58100e672e968916f32f9720523bdb",
        "lineStart": 82,
        "lineEnd": 84,
