    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7e3eb813e173360d1e78",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To configure nginx to serve Grafana under a _sub path_, update the `location` block:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Introduction",
        "Configure reverse proxy",
        "Configure nginx"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/tutorials/run-grafana-behind-a-proxy/index.md",
