      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana v8 introduced streaming capabilities – a way to push data to UI panels in near real-time. In this tutorial we show how Grafana real-time streaming capabilities can be used together with Telegraf to instantly display system measurements.",
