    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ef87d65baefdcb9c5062",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Role-based access control (RBAC) is now always enabled and we've removed the option to disable it.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Upgrade to Grafana v10.0",
        "Technical notes",
        "Role-based access control changes"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v10.0/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "dd17de6d803d293f6310407d7596f0488e510810",
        "sha256": "52030e0eb258ef2a3a422fc961da29d64d86c6314cc68fa8be47c0394340a21d",
        "lineStart": 31,
        "lineEnd": 31,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v10.0/index.md#L31-L31"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.459232c52ebc3126723f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "However, if you decide to **downgrade** for any reason and **disable RBAC**, you'll need to run through the following guide before upgrading again.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Upgrade to Grafana v10.0",
        "Technical notes",
        "Role-based access control changes"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v10.0/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "dd17de6d803d293f6310407d7596f0488e510810",
        "sha256": "52030e0eb258ef2a3a422fc961da29d64d86c6314cc68fa8be47c0394340a21d",
        "lineStart": 35,
        "lineEnd": 35,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v10.0/index.md#L35-L35"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.77df70a6fabd94eef8e4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The aforementioned sequence of actions (upgrade, downgrade, disable RBAC, upgrade again) causes legacy access control and role-based access control systems to be out of sync. As a side effect, permissions for some Grafana resources, like dashboards, might be lost. To prevent that from happening, before you upgrade Grafana back again, please take the following steps:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Upgrade to Grafana v10.0",
        "Technical notes",
        "Role-based access control changes"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v10.0/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "dd17de6d803d293f6310407d7596f0488e510810",
        "sha256": "52030e0eb258ef2a3a422fc961da29d64d86c6314cc68fa8be47c0394340a21d",
        "lineStart": 37,
        "lineEnd": 39,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v10.0/index.md#L37-L39"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
