    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.273c7468e073c851c676",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- You can fetch all your data sources using the `/api/datasources` API. Review the `uid` fields, comparing them to the correct format, as shown [in the docs](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/developers/http_api/data_source/#get-all-data-sources). Following is a script that can help, but note that it's missing authentication that you [have to add yourself](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/developers/http_api/#authenticating-api-requests):",
      "headingPath": [
