    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.835e19fea8244d394848",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Since Grafana 10.2, the endpoint to check compatible versions when installing a plugin using `grafana cli plugins install` changed, which led to Grafana dependency version no longer being taken into account. This might have led to some behavior where the CLI would install plugins that are not fully compatible based on the plugins definition of compatibility via `grafanaDependency` property in the `plugin.json` file.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Upgrade to Grafana v12.0",
        "Technical notes",
        "Enforcing stricter version compatibility checks in plugin CLI install commands"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v12.0/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b166cc2c022b2c90b4b8cf4b799f14f35b8d3f8a",
        "sha256": "a2a5393118afe370366dedd39dd09bc3d241107f8a440b67a2541b4c0bdbe544",
        "lineStart": 78,
        "lineEnd": 78,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v12.0/index.md#L78-L78"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f8717a99bfa27a2a5c52",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "We _do not_ recommend installing plugins declared as incompatible. However, if you need to force install a plugin despite it being declared as incompatible, refer to the [Installing a plugin from a ZIP](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/administration/plugin-management/#install-a-plugin-from-a-zip-file) guidance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Upgrade to Grafana v12.0",
        "Technical notes",
        "Enforcing stricter version compatibility checks in plugin CLI install commands",
        "What if I want to ignore the compatibility check?"
      ],
