    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e5f06a749078942bc855",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Git Sync early adopters:** A migration bug in Grafana v13.0.0 might cause dashboards and folders to be lost or reverted when upgrading from Grafana v12.x.x with Git Sync enabled. Upgrading from v13.0.0 to v13.0.1 does **not** recover lost data, and if you already upgraded, you must restore your database first, then upgrade to v13.0.1.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Upgrade to Grafana v13.0",
        "Technical notes"
      ],
      "source": {
