    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.85954bac4996316d0ae9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Image Renderer previously authenticated with Grafana using opaque tokens stored in the database when generating screenshots and PDFs. Grafana v13.0 enables the `renderAuthJWT` feature toggle by default, which switches authentication to stateless JSON Web Tokens (JWTs) that don't depend on the database.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Upgrade to Grafana v13.0",
        "Technical notes",
        "Image Renderer default authentication changed to JWTs"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v13.0/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f45eec63216c452b0eebba76d1eb812e54001903",
        "sha256": "471090ddf07331c874d83707d16041b15600bd3e6b1842af09268a9b6a6ffc40",
        "lineStart": 95,
        "lineEnd": 95,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v13.0/index.md#L95-L95"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.63eee24ff2d8c005fc69",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After upgrading to Grafana v13.0, if you use the Image Renderer, you must set a `[rendering]renderer_token` in your Grafana configuration file to a value that isn't empty or the default value (`-`), and configure the Image Renderer with the same token value. Restart your Grafana instance for the changes to take effect.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Upgrade to Grafana v13.0",
        "Technical notes",
        "Image Renderer default authentication changed to JWTs",
        "Action required"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v13.0/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f45eec63216c452b0eebba76d1eb812e54001903",
        "sha256": "471090ddf07331c874d83707d16041b15600bd3e6b1842af09268a9b6a6ffc40",
        "lineStart": 99,
        "lineEnd": 99,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v13.0/index.md#L99-L99"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.dce496fb8248a22dea7d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After upgrading to Grafana v13.0, to revert to opaque token authentication, disable the feature toggle in your Grafana configuration file:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Upgrade to Grafana v13.0",
        "Technical notes",
        "Image Renderer default authentication changed to JWTs",
        "Reverting to the previous behavior"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v13.0/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f45eec63216c452b0eebba76d1eb812e54001903",
        "sha256": "471090ddf07331c874d83707d16041b15600bd3e6b1842af09268a9b6a6ffc40",
        "lineStart": 105,
        "lineEnd": 105,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v13.0/index.md#L105-L105"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.11825e4626b948a1cf81",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana v13.0 automatically migrates folders and dashboards from the legacy SQL database to unified storage on startup. The migration runs once and is tracked in the `unifiedstorage_migration_log` table.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Upgrade to Grafana v13.0",
        "Technical notes",
        "Unified storage for folders and dashboards"
      ],
      "source": {
