    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b0b98691bfcc6d3fd5d4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you downgrade to an earlier Grafana version after the migration, the older version reads the stale legacy tables and doesn't reflect changes made in unified storage. To roll back, restore from the database backup you took before upgrading.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Upgrade to Grafana v13.0",
        "Technical notes",
        "Unified storage for folders and dashboards"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v13.0/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f45eec63216c452b0eebba76d1eb812e54001903",
        "sha256": "471090ddf07331c874d83707d16041b15600bd3e6b1842af09268a9b6a6ffc40",
        "lineStart": 131,
        "lineEnd": 132,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v13.0/index.md#L131-L132"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.62908c08adf224296dea",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you downgrade and then upgrade again without restoring a backup, any folders or dashboards created or modified during the downgrade aren't migrated automatically. If a backup isn't available, contact Grafana support for assistance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Upgrade to Grafana v13.0",
        "Technical notes",
        "Unified storage for folders and dashboards"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v13.0/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f45eec63216c452b0eebba76d1eb812e54001903",
        "sha256": "471090ddf07331c874d83707d16041b15600bd3e6b1842af09268a9b6a6ffc40",
        "lineStart": 134,
        "lineEnd": 135,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v13.0/index.md#L134-L135"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.05db74adf98807d56f99",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you use SQLite, the migration might fail with `database is locked` or `database table is locked` errors due to lock contention. Grafana automatically retries using the Parquet buffer, but if errors persist, increase `migration_cache_size_kb` or enable `migration_parquet_buffer` in the `[unified_storage]` section of your configuration file:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Upgrade to Grafana v13.0",
        "Technical notes",
        "Unified storage for folders and dashboards",
        "SQLite deployments"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v13.0/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f45eec63216c452b0eebba76d1eb812e54001903",
        "sha256": "471090ddf07331c874d83707d16041b15600bd3e6b1842af09268a9b6a6ffc40",
        "lineStart": 139,
        "lineEnd": 140,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v13.0/index.md#L139-L140"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
