    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cac904bf8537ffffa93f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana v13.0 tightens RBAC enforcement for custom roles, Terraform-managed roles, and role provisioning. Roles that contain deprecated permissions may fail during create, update, delete, or assignment operations. We recommend reviewing and updating affected roles proactively.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Upgrade to Grafana v13.0",
        "Technical notes",
        "RBAC enforcement changes for custom roles"
      ],
      "source": {
