    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4758ea4c477df33aa931",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**For example**: A release named \"11.2.3+security-01\" would consist of what was released in 11.2.3 PLUS the indicated security fix. Once released, the security fix will also then be automatically included in all future releases of the impacted version.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Strategies for upgrading your self-managed Grafana instance",
        "Grafana security releases: improved version naming convention"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/upgrade-guide/when-to-upgrade/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4d2b4a87fa81e54c20f7dba4437026da8cd92d2d",
