    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f70be6ec4ed18b31233d",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Roll back and report issues if you experience problems in dev or test.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Strategies for upgrading your self-managed Grafana instance",
        "Minimize the likelihood of bugs and problems during upgrade",
        "Bugs"
      ],
      "source": {
