    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6d4fc8234f6b0bb5d4b2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For activity closer to the present, use **Views 30 days** or **Errors 30 days**, or open [dashboard insights](#dashboard-insights) on a specific dashboard to see today's views. To get same-day detail across all dashboards, [export logs of usage insights](ref:export-logs-of-usage-insights) and [visualize the exported logs](#visualize-usage-insights-data).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Assess dashboard usage",
        "Sort dashboards by using insights data"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/assess-dashboard-usage/index.md",
