      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you set up your installation to [export logs of usage insights](ref:export-logs-of-usage-insights), there are two dashboards to help you take advantage of this data.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Assess dashboard usage",
