    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e7f2df1bb48723e52565",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Click **Use saved query** to open the **Saved queries** drawer. Choose a [saved query](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/#saved-queries) to reuse, click **Select query**, and proceed to step 13.",
