    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e307642e481f1a7ede93",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you copy a dashboard using the **Save As** feature it gets a new dashboard id, so annotations created on the source dashboard is no longer be visible on the copy. You can still show them if you add a new **Annotation Query** and filter by tags. However, this only works if the annotations on the source dashboard had tags to filter by.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotate visualizations",
        "Built-in query"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/annotate-visualizations/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "cb65749cc65b459f6446f1e69dca5f37680bfc36",
        "sha256": "96ad5dc71e81c8d933ff21780cb9a54c0be4a4048de74c2e9f22ecdad4a34fdc",
        "lineStart": 270,
        "lineEnd": 270,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/annotate-visualizations/index.md#L270-L270"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.909bd038818a54e5d6f2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Following are some query options specific to the built-in annotation query.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotate visualizations",
        "Built-in query"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/annotate-visualizations/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "cb65749cc65b459f6446f1e69dca5f37680bfc36",
        "sha256": "96ad5dc71e81c8d933ff21780cb9a54c0be4a4048de74c2e9f22ecdad4a34fdc",
        "lineStart": 272,
        "lineEnd": 272,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/annotate-visualizations/index.md#L272-L272"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7440325f81d93f2f84e1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can create new queries to fetch annotations from the built-in annotation query using the `-- Grafana --` data source by setting _Filter by_ to `Tags`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotate visualizations",
        "Built-in query",
        "Filter queries by tag"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/annotate-visualizations/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "cb65749cc65b459f6446f1e69dca5f37680bfc36",
        "sha256": "96ad5dc71e81c8d933ff21780cb9a54c0be4a4048de74c2e9f22ecdad4a34fdc",
        "lineStart": 276,
        "lineEnd": 276,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/annotate-visualizations/index.md#L276-L276"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9276b9bd6befc25cf378",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana also supports typeahead of existing tags, provide at least one tag.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotate visualizations",
        "Built-in query",
        "Filter queries by tag"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/annotate-visualizations/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "cb65749cc65b459f6446f1e69dca5f37680bfc36",
        "sha256": "96ad5dc71e81c8d933ff21780cb9a54c0be4a4048de74c2e9f22ecdad4a34fdc",
        "lineStart": 278,
        "lineEnd": 278,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/annotate-visualizations/index.md#L278-L278"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1e8d544921d0b6ad329c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, create an annotation query name `outages` and specify a tag `outage`. This query shows all annotations (from any dashboard or via API) with the `outage` tag. If multiple tags are defined in an annotation query, then Grafana only shows annotations matching all the tags. To modify the behavior, enable `Match any`, and Grafana shows annotations that contain any one of the tags you provided.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotate visualizations",
        "Built-in query",
        "Filter queries by tag"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/annotate-visualizations/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "cb65749cc65b459f6446f1e69dca5f37680bfc36",
        "sha256": "96ad5dc71e81c8d933ff21780cb9a54c0be4a4048de74c2e9f22ecdad4a34fdc",
        "lineStart": 280,
        "lineEnd": 280,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/annotate-visualizations/index.md#L280-L280"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6c02e1f0540d022b232f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you enable **Display annotations** on an externally shared dashboard that uses tag-based annotation queries, those queries return matching annotations from _all dashboards_ in the organization. This means annotations from dashboards that are not shared externally are visible to anyone with access to the shared dashboard. This is by design. Review which annotations might match your tags before enabling this option on a shared dashboard.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotate visualizations",
        "Built-in query",
        "Filter queries by tag"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/annotate-visualizations/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "cb65749cc65b459f6446f1e69dca5f37680bfc36",
        "sha256": "96ad5dc71e81c8d933ff21780cb9a54c0be4a4048de74c2e9f22ecdad4a34fdc",
        "lineStart": 283,
        "lineEnd": 283,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/annotate-visualizations/index.md#L283-L283"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.926a51cae6c94c90ba9f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can also use template variables in the tag query. This means if you have a dashboard showing stats for different services and a template variable that dictates which services to show, you can use the same template variable in your annotation query to only show annotations for those services.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotate visualizations",
        "Built-in query",
        "Filter queries by tag"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/annotate-visualizations/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "cb65749cc65b459f6446f1e69dca5f37680bfc36",
        "sha256": "96ad5dc71e81c8d933ff21780cb9a54c0be4a4048de74c2e9f22ecdad4a34fdc",
        "lineStart": 288,
        "lineEnd": 288,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/annotate-visualizations/index.md#L288-L288"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.688fc1b8005745efe173",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When adding or editing an annotation, you can define a repeating time region by setting **Query type** to **Time regions**. Then, define the **From** and **To** sections with the preferred days of the week and time. You also have the option to change the timezone, which is set to the dashboard's timezone, by default.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotate visualizations",
        "Built-in query",
        "Add time regions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/annotate-visualizations/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "cb65749cc65b459f6446f1e69dca5f37680bfc36",
        "sha256": "96ad5dc71e81c8d933ff21780cb9a54c0be4a4048de74c2e9f22ecdad4a34fdc",
        "lineStart": 294,
        "lineEnd": 294,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/annotate-visualizations/index.md#L294-L294"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.14c8a97bd422b654e8f6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Toggle the **Advanced** switch and use [Cron syntax](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cron) to set more granular time region controls. The following example sets a time region of 9:00 AM, Monday to Friday:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotate visualizations",
        "Built-in query",
        "Add time regions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/annotate-visualizations/index.md",
