    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.18b2501b4d54f581b7bd",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For more information about the different kinds of dashboards you can create, refer to [Grafana dashboards: A complete guide to all the different types you can build](https://grafana.com/blog/2022/06/06/grafana-dashboards-a-complete-guide-to-all-the-different-types-you-can-build/?pg=webinar-getting-started-with-grafana-dashboard-design-amer&plcmt=related-content-1).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana dashboard best practices"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/best-practices/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "df7f3f2e648b64895f6be11261c30021f9746e4f",
        "sha256": "5e3970ef4ca56f2803e0ad76022064bdfd847fcb3a9500b474f6ec96d7c2dbde",
        "lineStart": 76,
        "lineEnd": 76,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/best-practices/index.md#L76-L76"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c6b4735386d9980d6212",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you have a lot to monitor, like a server farm, you need a strategy to decide what is important enough to monitor. This page describes several common methods for choosing what to monitor.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana dashboard best practices",
        "Common observability strategies"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/best-practices/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "df7f3f2e648b64895f6be11261c30021f9746e4f",
        "sha256": "5e3970ef4ca56f2803e0ad76022064bdfd847fcb3a9500b474f6ec96d7c2dbde",
        "lineStart": 80,
        "lineEnd": 80,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/best-practices/index.md#L80-L80"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.959aed3e4288da8e81cf",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A logical strategy allows you to make uniform dashboards and scale your observability platform more easily.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana dashboard best practices",
        "Common observability strategies"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/best-practices/index.md",
