      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Prevent sprawl by using template variables. For example, you don't need a separate dashboard for each node, you can use query variables. Even better, you can make the data source a template variable too, so you can reuse the same dashboard across different clusters and monitoring backends.",
