      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "_Cognitive load_ is basically how hard you need to think about something in order to figure it out. Make your dashboard easy to interpret. Other users and future you (when you're trying to figure out what broke at 2 AM) will appreciate it.",
