      "id": "grafana.candidate.8050674850ec5fea878d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "There are several [common observability strategies](#common-observability-strategies). You should research them and decide whether one of them works for you or if you want to come up with your own. Either way, have a plan, write it down, and stick to it.",
