      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "What is your dashboard maturity level? Analyze your current dashboard setup and compare it to the [Dashboard management maturity model](#dashboard-management-maturity-model). Understanding where you are can help you decide how to get to where you want to be.",
