      "id": "grafana.candidate.d2e6705142876d9208a9",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Avoid dashboard sprawl, meaning the uncontrolled growth of dashboards. Dashboard sprawl negatively affects time to find the right dashboard. Duplicating dashboards and changing \"one thing\" (worse: keeping original tags) is the easiest kind of sprawl.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana dashboard best practices",
        "Best practices for managing dashboards",
        "Best practices to follow"
