      "sourceText": "You can also resize both the sidebar and toolbar. You can only resize the toolbar when the sidebar is closed and not docked, however, you can do so in view or edit mode. Your resizing changes persist until you change them.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create dashboards",
        "Dashboard edit",
        "The sidebar and toolbar",
        "Docked and undocked sidebar"
      ],
