    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d14e9ff18d26027d67af",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Edit existing elements | <p>Click the element to open the sidebar showing the relevant options. Click the **Dashboard options** icon to access dashboard settings.</p><p>If the dashboard is large, open the **Content outline** and use it to navigate to the part of the dashboard you want to update.</p>                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create dashboards",
        "Dashboard edit",
        "Edit a dashboard"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-dashboard/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "fd219e23bfc50a2e71b5702fad688f15b70f78b0",
        "sha256": "57452e87c1a1acc1456f97b28bae24dbe22704ca2f96e5f73591e1a6ff201fee",
        "lineStart": 240,
        "lineEnd": 240,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-dashboard/_index.md#L240-L240"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8f6ae882d033f22c32e7",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Add more panels        | <p>Click the **Add new element** icon and select **Panel**.</p><p>You can also hover your cursor on the dashboard to display the **Add panel** button. This is helpful if you want to ensure that you add a new panel within a grouping.</p>                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create dashboards",
        "Dashboard edit",
        "Edit a dashboard"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-dashboard/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "fd219e23bfc50a2e71b5702fad688f15b70f78b0",
        "sha256": "57452e87c1a1acc1456f97b28bae24dbe22704ca2f96e5f73591e1a6ff201fee",
        "lineStart": 241,
        "lineEnd": 241,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-dashboard/_index.md#L241-L241"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a4522c71eb304e3629f6",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Group panels           | <p>Click **Add new element** and select **Add row/Group into rows** or **Add tab/Group into tabs**.</p><p>Alternatively hover your cursor on the dashboard to display the **Group panels** and select a grouping option or select a specific set of panels and group them into rows or tabs.</p><p>For more information on groupings, refer to [Panel groupings](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-dashboard/dashboard-groupings/).</p>                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create dashboards",
        "Dashboard edit",
        "Edit a dashboard"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-dashboard/_index.md",
