      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you first create a dashboard, you select a layout and that selection becomes your the default for rows and tabs that you add to the dashboard. However, you can change this default in the dashboard settings.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create dashboards",
        "Panel layouts"
