      "id": "grafana.candidate.1648974728ec7011d96d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For the panel tracking weekly stats, a rule is set up to hide it if the dashboard time range is less than 7 days. For the panel tracking daily stats, a rule is set up to hide it if the dashboard time range is less 24 hours. This configuration ensures that these time-based panels are only displayed when enough time has passed to make them relevant.",
