      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To help create meaningful sections in your dashboard, you can group panels into rows or tabs. Rows and tabs let you break up big dashboards or make one dashboard out of several smaller ones.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Dashboard panel groupings"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-dashboard/dashboard-groupings.md",
