      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can think of the dashboard as a series of nested containers: the dashboard is the largest container and it contains panels, rows, or tabs. Rows and tabs are the next largest containers, and they contain panels or other rows and tabs.",
      "headingPath": [
