      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Filters       | Add filters that apply to only the panels in the grouping. For more information, refer to [Section-level variables and filters](#grouping-level-variables-and-filters). For information on configuring the **Filter and Group by** feature, refer to the [documentation](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-dashboard/dashboard-controls/#add-filters-and-group-by-controls). |",
