      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Layout          | Select the layout. If the grouping contains another grouping, choose from **Rows** or **Tabs**. If the grouping contains panels, choose from **Custom** or **Auto grid**. For more information, refer to [Panel layouts](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-dashboard/#panel-layouts) or [Grouping layouts](#grouping-layouts). |",
