    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2880f3e157cacb6f4964",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In dashboards that include multiple rows with nested tabs, you can drag and drop nested tabs between rows. To do this, the receiving row just needs to have one nested tab already.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Dashboard panel groupings",
        "Drag tabs between rows"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-dashboard/dashboard-groupings.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "7e666cc7cbb84b63dfee54bf067a6c03e784e7cf",
        "sha256": "c47f46f800915574767d871cfb0f709a00ffbc347d85e18000de024ef2f140d4",
        "lineStart": 249,
        "lineEnd": 250,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-dashboard/dashboard-groupings.md#L249-L250"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.23bc4de47654afbee1f6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you have a row with panels, but you want the panels to appear ungrouped, you can use the **Hide row header** switch in the row configuration to achieve this.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Dashboard panel groupings",
        "Place panels outside of groupings with headerless rows"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-dashboard/dashboard-groupings.md",
