    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.dda0443ffbfd800e3f80",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you choose this option, a preconfigured prompt is entered into the Assistant chat to start the process:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create dashboards from templates and suggestions",
        "Customize templates and suggested dashboards with Grafana Assistant"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-template-dashboards/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52f005c73a0445e8bc320433e957a43079b3cbd5",
        "sha256": "f810214e7fbd1b09ab192f1ca8072f07eac5cd8b9c51d4105366815b2c017cb1",
        "lineStart": 116,
        "lineEnd": 116,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-template-dashboards/_index.md#L116-L116"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.694e5ade3534f564cc42",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana Assistant analyses the template or suggested dashboard, checks your available data sources, and guides the creation of a dashboard tailored to your environment. This lets you create a working, relevant dashboard from a template or suggestion without the need to manually map metrics and panels.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create dashboards from templates and suggestions",
        "Customize templates and suggested dashboards with Grafana Assistant"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-template-dashboards/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52f005c73a0445e8bc320433e957a43079b3cbd5",
        "sha256": "f810214e7fbd1b09ab192f1ca8072f07eac5cd8b9c51d4105366815b2c017cb1",
        "lineStart": 122,
        "lineEnd": 123,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-template-dashboards/_index.md#L122-L123"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4a15c0ca7f0b392d2540",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana Assistant can query a subset of data sources, so customizing with Assistant for other data sources might generate poor results. For an up-to-date list of supported data sources, refer to the [Assistant documentation](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/machine-learning/assistant/guides/querying/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create dashboards from templates and suggestions",
        "Customize templates and suggested dashboards with Grafana Assistant"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-template-dashboards/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52f005c73a0445e8bc320433e957a43079b3cbd5",
        "sha256": "f810214e7fbd1b09ab192f1ca8072f07eac5cd8b9c51d4105366815b2c017cb1",
        "lineStart": 125,
        "lineEnd": 126,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-template-dashboards/_index.md#L125-L126"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2da2ea2a151e8d206c21",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The **Filter and Group by** option is one of the most complex and flexible dashboard controls available. Instead of creating a variable for each dimension by which you want to filter, it automatically queries your data source for available dimensions and lets users add or remove filters and group by dimensions on the dashboard dynamically. This allows you to quickly apply filters dashboard-wide.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Filter and group by controls"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f5dd2ef8fd1ceca2991036f9ca9cc9ef9cf1a7e7",
        "sha256": "dfea1aa43d84d96f7f759e31012001349c1e0258d1534786a51db7a1ff29de88",
        "lineStart": 32,
        "lineEnd": 34,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md#L32-L34"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.44fc6a5c81b0325f10ce",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The group by function allows you to then group data by keys, letting you split it up. This function is typically used with aggregation queries, such as `sum(your_metric_here)`, to split aggregated results by the selected dimensions. Then, you can use filters within panels to filter data in or out, drilling down further into the data.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Filter and group by controls"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f5dd2ef8fd1ceca2991036f9ca9cc9ef9cf1a7e7",
        "sha256": "dfea1aa43d84d96f7f759e31012001349c1e0258d1534786a51db7a1ff29de88",
        "lineStart": 36,
        "lineEnd": 38,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md#L36-L38"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cae11a8a8c2de4c3ed89",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The filter and group by feature lets you add label/value filter pairs that are automatically added to all queries that use the specified data source. Unlike variables, you don't use these filters in queries. Instead, you use them to write filters for existing queries.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Filter and group by controls"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f5dd2ef8fd1ceca2991036f9ca9cc9ef9cf1a7e7",
        "sha256": "dfea1aa43d84d96f7f759e31012001349c1e0258d1534786a51db7a1ff29de88",
        "lineStart": 40,
        "lineEnd": 42,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md#L40-L42"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a54b528a569407bd3da5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
