    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5074cf1c4bd4111afe83",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In some visualizations, you can apply filters directly from the visualization. Click on a series in the panel and then click **Filter on this value** or **Filter out this value**. This filters by the labels found on that series:",
