    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.695d0e1950200a43972f",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. To display the filter icons, hover your cursor over the data point with the value for which you want to filter. In this example, the table cell value is `ConfigMap Updated`, which is in the `alertname` column:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Filter and group by controls",
