    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5fac7b3912fbfb82e9a9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The filter pair `alertname = ConfigMap Updated` is added, and all panels using the same data source that include that value are filtered by it:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Filter and group by controls",
        "Cross-filtering",
        "Apply cross-filtering"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f5dd2ef8fd1ceca2991036f9ca9cc9ef9cf1a7e7",
        "sha256": "dfea1aa43d84d96f7f759e31012001349c1e0258d1534786a51db7a1ff29de88",
        "lineStart": 156,
        "lineEnd": 156,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md#L156-L156"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.46f5c6c476283093408f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If one of the panels in the dashboard using that data source doesn't include that filter value, the panel won't return any data. In this example, the filter pair `_name_ = ALERTS` has been added so the bar chart doesn't return any results:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Filter and group by controls",
        "Cross-filtering",
        "Apply cross-filtering"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f5dd2ef8fd1ceca2991036f9ca9cc9ef9cf1a7e7",
        "sha256": "dfea1aa43d84d96f7f759e31012001349c1e0258d1534786a51db7a1ff29de88",
        "lineStart": 160,
        "lineEnd": 160,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md#L160-L160"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ad6832d9da2dc8423ea2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For some visualizations, if your query doesn't include some type of data grouping, you might need to group the data first. For more information, refer to [Group from the panel](#group-from-the-panel).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Filter and group by controls",
        "Cross-filtering",
        "Apply cross-filtering"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f5dd2ef8fd1ceca2991036f9ca9cc9ef9cf1a7e7",
        "sha256": "dfea1aa43d84d96f7f759e31012001349c1e0258d1534786a51db7a1ff29de88",
        "lineStart": 164,
        "lineEnd": 165,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md#L164-L165"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.793a08aaabf9cdbeee14",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In cases where the data source you're using doesn't support filtering, consider using the special Dashboard data source. For more information, refer to [Filter any data using the Dashboard data source](#filter-any-data-using-the-dashboard-data-source).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Filter and group by controls",
        "Cross-filtering",
        "Apply cross-filtering"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f5dd2ef8fd1ceca2991036f9ca9cc9ef9cf1a7e7",
        "sha256": "dfea1aa43d84d96f7f759e31012001349c1e0258d1534786a51db7a1ff29de88",
        "lineStart": 167,
        "lineEnd": 168,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md#L167-L168"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f76e8b02ce51a144a1d8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When the **Group by** switch is toggled on, you can also set a group by dimension from a panel rather than from the dashboard-level control. Hover the cursor over any panel using the data source of the filter to show the **Group by** selector:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Filter and group by controls",
        "Cross-filtering",
        "Group from the panel"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f5dd2ef8fd1ceca2991036f9ca9cc9ef9cf1a7e7",
        "sha256": "dfea1aa43d84d96f7f759e31012001349c1e0258d1534786a51db7a1ff29de88",
        "lineStart": 172,
        "lineEnd": 173,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md#L172-L173"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bb2586726b5e3f67d580",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The panel-level **Group by** control only includes keys available in the panel's query. This is in contrast with the dashboard-level control that includes all available keys for the dashboard. Your selection is applied to all the panels in the dashboard with the same data source.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Filter and group by controls",
        "Cross-filtering",
        "Group from the panel"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f5dd2ef8fd1ceca2991036f9ca9cc9ef9cf1a7e7",
        "sha256": "dfea1aa43d84d96f7f759e31012001349c1e0258d1534786a51db7a1ff29de88",
        "lineStart": 177,
        "lineEnd": 178,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md#L177-L178"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0ef49b8adb435c7ac86f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In cases where a data source doesn't support the use of filters, you can use the Dashboard data source to reference that data, and then filter it in a new panel. This allows you to bypass the limitations of the data source in the source panel.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Filter and group by controls",
        "Filter any data using the Dashboard data source"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f5dd2ef8fd1ceca2991036f9ca9cc9ef9cf1a7e7",
        "sha256": "dfea1aa43d84d96f7f759e31012001349c1e0258d1534786a51db7a1ff29de88",
        "lineStart": 182,
        "lineEnd": 183,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md#L182-L183"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b8aaf604fb8cb3a8817f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To use filters on data from an unsupported data source, follow these steps:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Filter and group by controls",
        "Filter any data using the Dashboard data source"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/filter-group-by/index.md",
