      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f58e9da8e3cd3899a97d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana.com provides a library of official and community-created dashboards for common technologies and applications. You can browse the library, copy a dashboard's URL or ID, and import it directly into your Grafana instance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Import dashboards",
        "Frequently asked questions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/import-dashboards/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "516fd41633a76b745dbdbe187f0e4c982274c1ac",
        "sha256": "92390984f4f4c456fc5a24a7f4bf161c51e7f0596a7063be1a385759da3f22b2",
        "lineStart": 57,
        "lineEnd": 58,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/import-dashboards/index.md#L57-L58"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.17ad9912db479117e97c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Many imported dashboards contain queries that reference a data source. During import, Grafana lets you map those references to data sources that exist in your environment so the dashboard can display data correctly.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Import dashboards",
        "Frequently asked questions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/import-dashboards/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "516fd41633a76b745dbdbe187f0e4c982274c1ac",
        "sha256": "92390984f4f4c456fc5a24a7f4bf161c51e7f0596a7063be1a385759da3f22b2",
        "lineStart": 61,
        "lineEnd": 62,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/import-dashboards/index.md#L61-L62"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e2541b8f5dcb764fe792",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Yes. Dashboard import is supported in both Grafana Cloud and self-managed Grafana. Regardless of where your Grafana instance is running, you can import dashboards from a JSON file, by pasting dashboard JSON, or by using a dashboard URL or ID from Grafana.com.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Import dashboards",
        "Frequently asked questions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/import-dashboards/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "516fd41633a76b745dbdbe187f0e4c982274c1ac",
