      "id": "grafana.candidate.ea239d2c3d73ae3e7b47",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- `time` and `time.window` - defines a time range from `time-time.window/2` to `time+time.window/2`. Both params should be specified in ms. For example `?time=1500000000000&time.window=10000` will result in 10s time range from 1499999995000 to 1500000005000",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage dashboard links",
        "Controlling time range using the URL"
      ],
