    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.caadaca2f69738c5d8db",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Whenever you save a version of your dashboard, a copy of that version is saved so that previous versions of your dashboard are never lost. You can see a list of dashboard versions in the **Versions** tab of the dashboard settings:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage dashboard version history"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/manage-version-history/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "a975318e2a48bea223cc54180f9adc5cfddad5d7",
        "sha256": "d32533f3b9f93cdb1b541df04cf484b975b38b2aafd06ed71e04c23aef27f9dd",
        "lineStart": 25,
        "lineEnd": 25,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/manage-version-history/index.md#L25-L25"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f7ceb4edd92a78bf79c6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The dashboard version history feature lets you compare dashboards and restore previously saved dashboard versions. Grafana saves 20 versions by default. To change this limit, configure the [`[dashboards] versions_to_keep`](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#dashboards) setting.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage dashboard version history"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/build-dashboards/manage-version-history/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "a975318e2a48bea223cc54180f9adc5cfddad5d7",
