      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.af0193647e5e0198a2c0",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- The [Grafana image renderer service](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/image-rendering/) must be set up. Refer to [Image rendering](ref:image-rendering) for more information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create and manage reports",
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/create-reports/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f6e395abe8c144a9faa4899b27aef3d7aa6d9a97",
        "sha256": "5f797514c362142504fb59496b663b1eff8fc43cb59de71120eda2041b67b145",
        "lineStart": 99,
        "lineEnd": 99,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/create-reports/_index.md#L99-L99"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0787f2b127b3b154e1ad",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, attachments (PDFs, CSV files, and embedded images) larger than 10 MB are not sent, which keeps email servers from rejecting the email. You can increase or decrease this limit in the [reporting configuration](ref:max-size-configuration).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create and manage reports",
        "Requirements",
        "Rendering configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/create-reports/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f6e395abe8c144a9faa4899b27aef3d7aa6d9a97",
        "sha256": "5f797514c362142504fb59496b663b1eff8fc43cb59de71120eda2041b67b145",
        "lineStart": 103,
        "lineEnd": 104,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/create-reports/_index.md#L103-L104"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.96935988c81788769055",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When a report file is generated, it's temporarily written to the corresponding folder (`csv`, `pdf`, `png`) in the Grafana `data` folder. A background job runs every 10 minutes and removes temporary files. You can set how long a file should be stored before being removed by configuring the [`temp_data_lifetime`](ref:temp-data-lifetime) setting in your `ini` file.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create and manage reports",
        "Requirements",
        "Rendering configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/create-reports/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f6e395abe8c144a9faa4899b27aef3d7aa6d9a97",
        "sha256": "5f797514c362142504fb59496b663b1eff8fc43cb59de71120eda2041b67b145",
        "lineStart": 106,
        "lineEnd": 108,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/create-reports/_index.md#L106-L108"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6f3d54ec94045c9e4d24",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Only organization administrators can create reports by default. You can customize who can create reports with [role-based access control (RBAC)](ref:rbac).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create and manage reports",
        "Access control"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/create-reports/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f6e395abe8c144a9faa4899b27aef3d7aa6d9a97",
        "sha256": "5f797514c362142504fb59496b663b1eff8fc43cb59de71120eda2041b67b145",
        "lineStart": 112,
        "lineEnd": 113,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/create-reports/_index.md#L112-L113"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d4b96e98ca4b60ddaa49",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When [RBAC](ref:rbac) is enabled, you need to have the relevant [permissions](ref:permission) to create and manage reports. Refer to specific guides to understand what permissions are required.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create and manage reports",
        "Access control"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/create-reports/_index.md",
