      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you leave the **Time range** field empty, reports use the saved time range of the dashboard. Optionally, you can change the time range of the report by setting it in the **Time range** field. If specified, the custom time range overrides the time range from the report's dashboard.",
