      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Configure report-specific template variables for the dashboard. The variables that you select override the variables from the dashboard. For detailed information about using template variables, refer to [Variables](ref:templates-and-variables).",
