    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.96bfbb4b08049e60cbed",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Send on the last day of the month | When you schedule a report with a monthly frequency, and set the start date between the 29th and the 31st of the month, the report is only sent during the months that have those dates. If you want the report to be sent every month, select the **Send on the last day of the month** option. This way, the report is sent on the last day of every month regardless of how many days there are in the month. |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create and manage reports",
        "Create a report",
        "2. Schedule"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/create-reports/_index.md",
