      "sourceText": "The redesigned reporting feature, including the report settings drawer, is currently in public preview. Grafana Labs offers limited support, and breaking changes might occur prior to the feature being made generally available. To use this feature, enable the `newShareReportDrawer` feature toggle in your Grafana configuration file or, for Grafana Cloud, contact Support.",
