    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ba99d6fb8e6963aee4c1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Dashboards** - Deleted dashboards are stored in the deletion history and can be [restored](#restore-dashboards) if needed.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage dashboards",
        "Dashboard and folder deletion"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/manage-dashboards/index.md",
