      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can access the list of deleted dashboards from the **Dashboards** page by clicking the **Recently deleted** button, or by navigating to **Dashboards > Recently deleted**.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage dashboards",
        "Restore deleted dashboards"
