      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A dashboard snapshot publicly shares a dashboard while removing sensitive data such as queries and panel links, leaving only visible metrics and series names. Anyone with the link can access the snapshot.",
