      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Externally shared dashboards _should_ work with any data source that has the properties `backend` and `alerting` both set to true in its `plugin.json`. However, this can't always be guaranteed because plugin developers can override this functionality. The following lists include data sources confirmed to work with externally shared dashboards and data sources that should work, but have not been confirmed as compatible.",
