    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3fad709fff1ea127011b",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Tag-based annotation queries, using the `-- Grafana --` data source with **Filter by Tags**, return matching annotations from _all dashboards_ in the organization, not only the shared dashboard. This means annotations from dashboards that are not shared externally can be visible to anyone viewing the shared dashboard. This is by design. If you use tag-based annotation queries on a shared dashboard, ensure you are comfortable with the annotations from other dashboards in your organization being exposed to external viewers.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Externally shared dashboards",
        "Limitations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/share-dashboards-panels/shared-dashboards.md",
