      "id": "grafana.candidate.0fd0718033d1bc2b56e2",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Are you trying to render dozens (or hundreds or thousands) of time series on a graph? This can cause the browser to lag. Try using functions like `highestMax` (in Graphite) to reduce the number of returned series.",
