    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2833f11f4ef8e3dbaf72",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Are you querying many time series or a long time range? Both of these conditions can cause Grafana or your data source to pull in a lot of data, which may slow the dashboard down. Try reducing one or both of these.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot dashboards",
        "Dashboard is slow"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/troubleshoot-dashboards/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "db602354c1a9cedeeb691d2bb82aa2cd6ca24492",
        "sha256": "03a001ca2f64d945ef650e8d97053485ec657919baf1b0f54e7c194cc8c1000f",
        "lineStart": 31,
        "lineEnd": 31,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/troubleshoot-dashboards/index.md#L31-L31"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4278ce84b5e241abfa5e",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- There could be high load on your network infrastructure. If the slowness isn't consistent, this may be the problem.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot dashboards",
        "Dashboard is slow"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/troubleshoot-dashboards/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "db602354c1a9cedeeb691d2bb82aa2cd6ca24492",
        "sha256": "03a001ca2f64d945ef650e8d97053485ec657919baf1b0f54e7c194cc8c1000f",
        "lineStart": 32,
        "lineEnd": 32,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/troubleshoot-dashboards/index.md#L32-L32"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.567eaca6fdba919d1604",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, Grafana queries your data source every 30 seconds. However, setting a low refresh rate on your dashboards puts unnecessary stress on the backend. In many cases, querying this frequently isn't necessary because the data source isn't sending data often enough for there to be changes every 30 seconds.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot dashboards",
        "Dashboard refresh rate issues"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/troubleshoot-dashboards/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "db602354c1a9cedeeb691d2bb82aa2cd6ca24492",
        "sha256": "03a001ca2f64d945ef650e8d97053485ec657919baf1b0f54e7c194cc8c1000f",
        "lineStart": 36,
        "lineEnd": 36,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/troubleshoot-dashboards/index.md#L36-L36"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2313ecf50ad7ebbbf7d1",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Only enable auto-refreshing on dashboards, panels, or variables if necessary. Users can refresh their browser manually.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot dashboards",
        "Dashboard refresh rate issues"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/troubleshoot-dashboards/index.md",
