    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0ed055be1bf5c41b006f",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- If you require auto-refreshing, then set the refresh rate to a longer time period that makes sense, such as once a minute, every 10 minutes, or every hour.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot dashboards",
        "Dashboard refresh rate issues"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/troubleshoot-dashboards/index.md",
