    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0e94e5522e4d63b2935f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you click a data point expecting the tooltip to stay open so you can scroll or copy its content, but the tooltip immediately disappears or resets, the **Refresh live dashboards** setting is likely the cause.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot dashboards",
        "Tooltip doesn't stay open when clicked"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/troubleshoot-dashboards/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "db602354c1a9cedeeb691d2bb82aa2cd6ca24492",
        "sha256": "03a001ca2f64d945ef650e8d97053485ec657919baf1b0f54e7c194cc8c1000f",
        "lineStart": 63,
        "lineEnd": 63,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/troubleshoot-dashboards/index.md#L63-L63"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0d9a83542c81e5c2ee57",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you enable **Refresh live dashboards** on a dashboard, Grafana continuously re-renders panels as data arrives. If the refresh interval is too low, each re-render dismisses any pinned tooltip before you can interact with it.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot dashboards",
        "Tooltip doesn't stay open when clicked"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/troubleshoot-dashboards/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "db602354c1a9cedeeb691d2bb82aa2cd6ca24492",
        "sha256": "03a001ca2f64d945ef650e8d97053485ec657919baf1b0f54e7c194cc8c1000f",
        "lineStart": 65,
        "lineEnd": 66,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/troubleshoot-dashboards/index.md#L65-L66"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cdfcbfb3bee383fb88c8",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Disable live refresh**: Open the dashboard settings, go to **General**, and toggle off the **Refresh live dashboards** switch. Tooltips remain open on click after the next render cycle.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot dashboards",
        "Tooltip doesn't stay open when clicked"
      ],
      "source": {
