    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8f952350b9519ef83c31",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Increase the refresh interval**: If you need live updates, open the dashboard settings, go to **General**, and increase the **Auto refresh** value. This provides enough time between dashboard re-renders for the tooltip to remain open.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Troubleshoot dashboards",
