    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ce15fd7b442dc1f9aec5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Using a semi-relative time range, as time progresses, your dashboard will automatically and progressively zoom out to show more history and fewer details. At the same rate, as high data resolution decreases, historical trends over the entire time period will become more clear.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use dashboards",
        "Set dashboard time range",
        "Common time range controls",
        "Semi-relative time range"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/use-dashboards/index.md",
