    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f12e2df4f5ff1e835b8c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Click the **Refresh dashboard** icon to immediately run every query on the dashboard and refresh the visualizations. Grafana cancels any pending requests when you trigger a refresh.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use dashboards",
        "Set dashboard time range",
        "Common time range controls",
        "Refresh dashboard"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/use-dashboards/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f755d0704ca4e884c68952e657ea8401c4f893ae",
        "sha256": "c18dbe51e51f8d1aa1d443bef92b9422b5748258e6c053bcbee34eb3289ab0fb",
        "lineStart": 361,
        "lineEnd": 361,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/use-dashboards/index.md#L361-L361"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7e693b2ea4db2db74b2f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, Grafana does not automatically refresh the dashboard. Queries run on their own schedule according to the panel settings. However, if you want to regularly refresh the dashboard, click the down arrow next to the **Refresh dashboard** icon, and then select a refresh interval.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use dashboards",
        "Set dashboard time range",
        "Common time range controls",
        "Refresh dashboard"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/use-dashboards/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f755d0704ca4e884c68952e657ea8401c4f893ae",
        "sha256": "c18dbe51e51f8d1aa1d443bef92b9422b5748258e6c053bcbee34eb3289ab0fb",
        "lineStart": 363,
        "lineEnd": 363,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/use-dashboards/index.md#L363-L363"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e04c3463f79f6b17ab83",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Selecting the **Auto** interval schedules a refresh based on the query time range and browser window width. Short time ranges update frequently, while longer ones update infrequently. There is no need to refresh more often then the pixels available to draw any updates.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use dashboards",
        "Set dashboard time range",
        "Common time range controls",
        "Refresh dashboard"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/use-dashboards/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f755d0704ca4e884c68952e657ea8401c4f893ae",
        "sha256": "c18dbe51e51f8d1aa1d443bef92b9422b5748258e6c053bcbee34eb3289ab0fb",
        "lineStart": 365,
        "lineEnd": 365,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/use-dashboards/index.md#L365-L365"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e088e2b7ce399a2a4715",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After you've added a filter in the dashboard settings, you can create label/value filter pairs on the dashboard. These filters are applied to all metric queries that use the specified data source and to all panels on the dashboard.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Use dashboards",
        "Filter dashboard data"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/use-dashboards/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f755d0704ca4e884c68952e657ea8401c4f893ae",
