      "id": "grafana.candidate.638f5c5d0a3becad8d67",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, if you need to monitor several servers, you _could_ make a dashboard for each server. Or you could create one dashboard and use panels with variables like this one, where you can change the server using the variable selector:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Variables"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/variables/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0771de76715ca4fb8930580bfcc5e3337f1634b9",
        "sha256": "b5119c058e565b1cd9b7f71bad043dd74f0290e0c7f4d5363a8ecd935284e1ed",
        "lineStart": 25,
        "lineEnd": 26,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/variables/_index.md#L25-L26"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.281f2d953ae001c5dc0c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Variables help you create interactive dashboards that adapt to different contexts. Instead of hard-coding values such as server, application, region, or sensor names, you can define a variable once and reuse it throughout the dashboard.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Variables"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/variables/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0771de76715ca4fb8930580bfcc5e3337f1634b9",
        "sha256": "b5119c058e565b1cd9b7f71bad043dd74f0290e0c7f4d5363a8ecd935284e1ed",
        "lineStart": 30,
        "lineEnd": 31,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/variables/_index.md#L30-L31"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6f7699be4fbd3dbadaf7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Using variables also allows you to single-source dashboards. If you have multiple identical data sources or servers, you can make one dashboard and use variables to change what you are viewing. This reduces dashboard duplication and maintenance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Variables"
      ],
      "source": {
