      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.67501c79be0edbd7f107",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The following image shows a panel in edit mode using the query:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Variables",
        "Template variables"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/variables/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0771de76715ca4fb8930580bfcc5e3337f1634b9",
        "sha256": "b5119c058e565b1cd9b7f71bad043dd74f0290e0c7f4d5363a8ecd935284e1ed",
        "lineStart": 95,
        "lineEnd": 95,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/variables/_index.md#L95-L95"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0a2e9e30f8a187d2b140",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, variable values are synced to the URL using [query parameter syntax](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/visualizations/dashboards/variables/variable-syntax/#query-parameters), `var-<varname>=value`. For example:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Variables",
        "Template variables",
        "Variables in URLs"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/variables/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0771de76715ca4fb8930580bfcc5e3337f1634b9",
        "sha256": "b5119c058e565b1cd9b7f71bad043dd74f0290e0c7f4d5363a8ecd935284e1ed",
        "lineStart": 105,
        "lineEnd": 106,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/variables/_index.md#L105-L106"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.36b8a424b5378fa1d388",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can prevent a variable from being synced to the URL by setting `skipUrlSync` to `true` in the variable definition within the dashboard JSON model. When set, the variable value won't appear as a `var-` query parameter in the URL.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Variables",
        "Template variables",
        "Variables in URLs"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/variables/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0771de76715ca4fb8930580bfcc5e3337f1634b9",
        "sha256": "b5119c058e565b1cd9b7f71bad043dd74f0290e0c7f4d5363a8ecd935284e1ed",
        "lineStart": 114,
        "lineEnd": 114,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/variables/_index.md#L114-L114"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c4a81c82e1bd72140203",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This is useful when you want to keep URLs clean, prevent users from overriding a variable value through the URL, or avoid exposing sensitive values in shared links.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Variables",
        "Template variables",
        "Variables in URLs"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/variables/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0771de76715ca4fb8930580bfcc5e3337f1634b9",
        "sha256": "b5119c058e565b1cd9b7f71bad043dd74f0290e0c7f4d5363a8ecd935284e1ed",
        "lineStart": 116,
        "lineEnd": 116,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/variables/_index.md#L116-L116"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4e79dc8db0792f313b7d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Constant variables have `skipUrlSync` set to `true` by default, since their value is fixed and not intended to be changed through the URL.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Variables",
        "Template variables",
        "Variables in URLs"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/variables/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0771de76715ca4fb8930580bfcc5e3337f1634b9",
        "sha256": "b5119c058e565b1cd9b7f71bad043dd74f0290e0c7f4d5363a8ecd935284e1ed",
        "lineStart": 119,
        "lineEnd": 119,
