    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c4c977bff80fc2aefb5d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana adds an **All** option to the variable drop-down list. If a user selects this option, then all variable options are selected.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add variables",
        "Variable selection options",
        "Include All option"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/variables/add-template-variables.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4457b936a9bfd014008fb8f048e6298c3d09adf4",
        "sha256": "4974eb465335c4f545040002170c2cbf56fce6881ca54c1b130c25cf2a89ca17",
        "lineStart": 398,
        "lineEnd": 398,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/variables/add-template-variables.md#L398-L398"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9d0f3c10f7fb0a71f465",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you enable this option but also set a variable's **Display** option to **Hidden**, the variable defaults to selecting only the first value&mdash;not **All**&mdash;unless you explicitly select **All** while the variable is visible and then save the dashboard. To set **All** as the default for a hidden variable, complete the following steps:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Add variables",
        "Variable selection options",
        "Include All option"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/variables/add-template-variables.md",
