    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8181bc4d5f3207c194bf",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In this example, when the user changes the value of the `datacenter` variable, it changes the drop-down options returned by the `host` variable. The `host` variable uses the **Multi-value** option and **Include all option**, allowing users to select some or all options presented at any time. The `datacenter` does not use either option, so you can only select one data center at a time.",
      "headingPath": [
