      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can change the orders of variables in the dashboard variable list by clicking the up and down arrows on the right side of each entry. Grafana lists variable dropdowns left to right according to this list, with the variable at the top on the far left.",
