      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, if you have a series of four linked variables (country, region, server, metric) and you change a root variable value (country), then Grafana must run queries for all the dependent variables before it updates the visualizations in the dashboard.",
