      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Using the **Regex** query option, you filter the list of options returned by the Variable query or modify the options returned. For more information, refer to the Mozilla guide on [Regular expressions](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Guide/Regular_Expressions).",
      "headingPath": [
