      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Using named capture groups, you can capture separate 'text' and 'value' parts from the options returned by the variable query. This allows the variable drop-down list to contain a friendly name for each value that can be selected.",
