      "sourceText": "| `${__from:date:YYYY-MM}` | 2020-07                  | Any custom [date format](https://momentjs.com/docs/#/displaying/) that doesn't include the `:` character. Uses browser time. Use `:date` or `:date:iso` for UTC                                                                                 |",
