      "id": "grafana.candidate.023740c2ab960d05781a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Currently only supported for Prometheus and Loki data sources. This variable represents the range for the current dashboard. It's calculated by `to - from`. It has a millisecond and a second representation called `$__range_ms` and `$__range_s`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Global variables",
        "`$__range`"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/dashboards/variables/global-variables.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "47197c2d57632cafd89e881be4dbd3d8f67f4bca",
        "sha256": "96d599ac5546da4d5eff868adb4c39ebca5e8cd399dad64323c6d6aac90cab33",
