      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In addition to managing variables, the **Variables** section lets you quickly identify whether variables have any dependencies. To check, click **Show dependencies** at the bottom of the list, which opens the dependencies diagram:",
