      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Refer to [Role-based access control (RBAC)](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/) in Grafana Enterprise to understand how you can manage Explore with role-based permissions.",
