    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.78b9515b23350e347ea4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can select a different data source, or different metrics and label filters for the new query, allowing you to compare the same query across two different servers or compare the staging environment with the production environment.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Get started with Explore",
        "Explore elements",
        "Toolbar",
        "Split and compare"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/explore/get-started-with-explore.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8f5dffb77daf93f254dfa94bc379b04d3071471e",
        "sha256": "d9598c4a3a1a79d06034c181a325f3fd1282885baaffe6c11a50d4c1da29f8aa",
        "lineStart": 92,
        "lineEnd": 92,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/explore/get-started-with-explore.md#L92-L92"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.19de9b473e23bc868ee4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can also link the time pickers for both panels by clicking on one of the time-sync buttons attached to the time pickers. When linked, changing the time in one panel automatically updates the other, keeping the start and end times synchronized. This ensures that both split panels display data for the same time interval.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Get started with Explore",
        "Explore elements",
        "Toolbar",
        "Split and compare"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/explore/get-started-with-explore.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8f5dffb77daf93f254dfa94bc379b04d3071471e",
