      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Refer to [Query editor in Explore](http://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/visualizations/explore/query-editor/) for detailed information on the query editor.",
      "headingPath": [
