      "id": "grafana.candidate.0aca7487ed08ad057758",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Explore may generate long URLs, which some tools, like messaging or videoconferencing applications, might truncate due to fixed message lengths. In such cases, Explore displays a warning and loads a default state. If you encounter issues when sharing Explore links in these applications, you can generate shortened links. See [Share shortened link](#share-shortened-link) for more information.",
      "headingPath": [
