      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Explore replaces these sequences, changing the option from **Escape newlines** to **Remove escaping**. Assess the changes, as the parsing may not be accurate based on the input. To revert the replacements, click **Remove escaping**.",
