    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ebbc8025b62f3b1ba510",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When your query includes specific words or expressions for keyword search, Explore highlights them in log lines to enhance visibility. This highlighting feature facilitates easier identification and focus on the relevant content within your logs.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Logs in Explore",
        "Logs",
        "Highlight searched words"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/explore/logs-integration.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b7571ffd9ad594743a288d44864ef8345da24da3",
        "sha256": "b0f79a39962e882c64be93fe96137f34e336b4f6ad92fc5cdbdbfb84e3fa0a96",
        "lineStart": 137,
        "lineEnd": 137,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/explore/logs-integration.md#L137-L137"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.acc04e132ed02294181f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In Explore, each log line has an expandable section called **Log details** that you open by clicking on the log line. The Log details view provides additional information and exploration options in the form of **Fields** and **Links** attached to the log lines, enabling a more robust interaction and analysis.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Logs in Explore",
        "Logs",
        "Log details view"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/explore/logs-integration.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b7571ffd9ad594743a288d44864ef8345da24da3",
        "sha256": "b0f79a39962e882c64be93fe96137f34e336b4f6ad92fc5cdbdbfb84e3fa0a96",
        "lineStart": 145,
        "lineEnd": 145,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/explore/logs-integration.md#L145-L145"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ccafd4c493cafbd7ae9d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Within the **Log details** view, you have the ability to filter the displayed fields in two ways: a positive filter, which focuses on an specific field and a negative filter, which excludes certain fields. These filters modify the corresponding query that generated the log line, incorporating equality and inequality expressions accordingly.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Logs in Explore",
        "Logs",
        "Log details view",
        "Fields"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/explore/logs-integration.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b7571ffd9ad594743a288d44864ef8345da24da3",
        "sha256": "b0f79a39962e882c64be93fe96137f34e336b4f6ad92fc5cdbdbfb84e3fa0a96",
        "lineStart": 149,
        "lineEnd": 150,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/explore/logs-integration.md#L149-L150"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9a4179a94253d0980d77",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the data source supports it, as is the case with Loki and Elasticsearch, log details will verify whether the field is already included in the current query, indicating an active state for positive filters. This enables you to toggle it off from the query or convert the filter expression from positive to negative as necessary.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Logs in Explore",
        "Logs",
        "Log details view",
        "Fields"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/explore/logs-integration.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b7571ffd9ad594743a288d44864ef8345da24da3",
        "sha256": "b0f79a39962e882c64be93fe96137f34e336b4f6ad92fc5cdbdbfb84e3fa0a96",
        "lineStart": 152,
        "lineEnd": 152,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/explore/logs-integration.md#L152-L152"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a28f0f8617db26177ec8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Click the **eye icon** to select a subset of fields to visualize in the logs list instead of the complete log line.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Logs in Explore",
        "Logs",
        "Log details view",
        "Fields"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/explore/logs-integration.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b7571ffd9ad594743a288d44864ef8345da24da3",
        "sha256": "b0f79a39962e882c64be93fe96137f34e336b4f6ad92fc5cdbdbfb84e3fa0a96",
        "lineStart": 154,
        "lineEnd": 154,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/explore/logs-integration.md#L154-L154"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
