    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1a9df5b0770a42e5fa86",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the selected data source supports log samples and both log and metric queries, you will automatically see log line samples that contribute to the visualized metrics for metric queries. **This feature is currently only supported by the Loki data source.**",
      "headingPath": [
        "Logs in Explore",
        "Live tailing",
        "Logs sample"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/explore/logs-integration.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b7571ffd9ad594743a288d44864ef8345da24da3",
        "sha256": "b0f79a39962e882c64be93fe96137f34e336b4f6ad92fc5cdbdbfb84e3fa0a96",
        "lineStart": 218,
        "lineEnd": 218,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/explore/logs-integration.md#L218-L218"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.60609eb6254990a02b90",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you are transitioning from a metrics data source that implements `DataSourceWithQueryExportSupport` (such as Prometheus) to a logging data source that supports `DataSourceWithQueryImportSupport` (such as Loki), Explore retains the labels from your query that exist in the logs and use them to query the log streams.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Logs in Explore",
        "Live tailing",
        "Switch from metrics to logs"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/explore/logs-integration.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b7571ffd9ad594743a288d44864ef8345da24da3",
        "sha256": "b0f79a39962e882c64be93fe96137f34e336b4f6ad92fc5cdbdbfb84e3fa0a96",
        "lineStart": 222,
        "lineEnd": 222,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/explore/logs-integration.md#L222-L222"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.187a6e690adb0639ee86",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, after switching to the Loki data source, the Prometheus query `grafana_alerting_active_alerts{job=\"grafana\"}` changes to `{job=\"grafana\"}`. This will retrieve a set of logs within the specified time range, which can be searched using grep or text search.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Logs in Explore",
        "Live tailing",
        "Switch from metrics to logs"
      ],
      "source": {
