    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f7e9f74b00c764d260b1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Panels are the basic building block in Grafana dashboards, composed of a [query](ref:query) and a visualization, a graphical representation of query results.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "642c1ba183bc244133caaf4110992ba12ecb8ede",
        "sha256": "205b672a13a899ba352ebbd20239348c96f8561ad920446849862e620183a181",
        "lineStart": 65,
        "lineEnd": 65,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/_index.md#L65-L65"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.faaed91553006809f370",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Visualizations provide you several different ways to present your data within a panel, depending on what best suits the data and your needs. Grafana’s growing suite of visualizations, ranging from time series graphs to heatmaps to cutting-edge 3D charts, help you decode complex datasets.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "642c1ba183bc244133caaf4110992ba12ecb8ede",
        "sha256": "205b672a13a899ba352ebbd20239348c96f8561ad920446849862e620183a181",
        "lineStart": 67,
        "lineEnd": 67,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/_index.md#L67-L67"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.30240c465dd3b0bb3269",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Panels offer a wide variety of formatting and styling options from applying colors based on field values to custom units. Each visualization also comes with options specific to it that give you further control over how your data is displayed. With Grafana panels and visualizations, you can easily get the information you need from your data and optimize performance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "642c1ba183bc244133caaf4110992ba12ecb8ede",
        "sha256": "205b672a13a899ba352ebbd20239348c96f8561ad920446849862e620183a181",
        "lineStart": 69,
        "lineEnd": 69,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/_index.md#L69-L69"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.738d84bdd126d2f2024e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "_Data links_ allow you to link to other panels, dashboards, and external resources and _actions_ let you trigger basic, unauthenticated, API calls. In both cases, you can carry out these tasks while maintaining the context of the source panel.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure data links and actions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-data-links/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52b518d5fb668d6ae767f46e2145f7f75f81fddd",
        "sha256": "321a3ebb6a43bc1aae34e0f45e7f6a3b3ad438684a871ecadfad37a4c0370797",
        "lineStart": 134,
        "lineEnd": 135,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-data-links/index.md#L134-L135"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ab4c58c888af6cc3e667",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "With data links, you can create links that include the series name or even the value under the cursor. For example, if your visualization shows four servers, you can add a data link to one or two of them.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure data links and actions",
        "Data links"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-data-links/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52b518d5fb668d6ae767f46e2145f7f75f81fddd",
        "sha256": "321a3ebb6a43bc1aae34e0f45e7f6a3b3ad438684a871ecadfad37a4c0370797",
        "lineStart": 139,
        "lineEnd": 139,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-data-links/index.md#L139-L139"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.dabc852a165cb1f91159",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The link itself is accessible in different ways depending on the visualization. For the time series visualization you need to click a data point or line:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure data links and actions",
        "Data links"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-data-links/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52b518d5fb668d6ae767f46e2145f7f75f81fddd",
        "sha256": "321a3ebb6a43bc1aae34e0f45e7f6a3b3ad438684a871ecadfad37a4c0370797",
        "lineStart": 141,
        "lineEnd": 141,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-data-links/index.md#L141-L141"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c970a96551e7680bf581",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For visualizations like stat, gauge, or bar gauge you can click anywhere on the visualization to open the context menu:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure data links and actions",
        "Data links"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-data-links/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "52b518d5fb668d6ae767f46e2145f7f75f81fddd",
        "sha256": "321a3ebb6a43bc1aae34e0f45e7f6a3b3ad438684a871ecadfad37a4c0370797",
        "lineStart": 145,
        "lineEnd": 145,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-data-links/index.md#L145-L145"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.be97eb2e35cda1bc112f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If there's only one data link in the visualization, clicking anywhere on the visualization opens the link rather than the context menu.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure data links and actions",
        "Data links"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-data-links/index.md",
