      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The `queryparam` format generates the ampersand (`&`) _within_ a single multi-value variable, as shown in the previous table. However, it doesn't automatically insert an ampersand _between_ different template variables. When you combine multiple template variables in one URL, you must add the ampersand yourself:",
