      "id": "grafana.candidate.18471b151f3d7d12c670",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Visualizations can often be visually complex, and include many data series. You can simplify the view by removing series data from the visualization through the legend, which isolates the data you want to see. When you do this, Grafana automatically creates a new override in the **Override** section.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure a legend",
        "Isolate series data in a visualization"
