      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can configure Grafana to dynamically add panels to a dashboard. A dynamic panel is a panel that the system creates based on the value of a multi-value variable. Variables dynamically change your queries across all panels in a dashboard.",
