      "id": "grafana.candidate.1ab8178f877bec789219",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Layout changes don't persist**: Each time the dashboard loads or refreshes, Grafana regenerates repeated panels from the source panel. Any layout changes you make to the generated copies are overwritten on reload.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure panel options",
        "Configure repeating panels",
        "Limitations of repeating panels"
