    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.eaebc02c69b375866394",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To set these options, expand the **Standard options** section in the panel editor pane. Most field options won't affect the visualization until you click outside of the field option box you're editing or press Enter.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure standard options",
        "Standard options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-standard-options/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ca35f5df71c05c5973caefa1e0072b3807af2ec8",
        "sha256": "1d79d81e63f81955cf0d33dd1bd627c50a252189774bb19194b60771a90499cd",
        "lineStart": 155,
        "lineEnd": 155,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-standard-options/index.md#L155-L155"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.eb85148706c5efab00f6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This option lets you choose which unit a field should use. Click in the **Unit** field, then drill down until you find the unit you want. The unit you select is applied to all fields except time.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure standard options",
        "Standard options",
        "Unit"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-standard-options/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ca35f5df71c05c5973caefa1e0072b3807af2ec8",
        "sha256": "1d79d81e63f81955cf0d33dd1bd627c50a252189774bb19194b60771a90499cd",
        "lineStart": 163,
        "lineEnd": 163,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-standard-options/index.md#L163-L163"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c6aaacbeea44026bcd78",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can also use the **Unit** drop-down to specify custom units, custom prefixes or suffixes, and date time formats.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure standard options",
        "Standard options",
        "Unit",
        "Custom units"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-standard-options/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ca35f5df71c05c5973caefa1e0072b3807af2ec8",
        "sha256": "1d79d81e63f81955cf0d33dd1bd627c50a252189774bb19194b60771a90499cd",
        "lineStart": 167,
        "lineEnd": 167,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-standard-options/index.md#L167-L167"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.93a1694e317595c480a3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To set a custom unit, enter the unit you want to use and then select it in the drop-down. It'll be the last option listed. For example, if you enter a unit called \"Hearts\", the drop-down will then include the option **Custom unit: Hearts**.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure standard options",
        "Standard options",
        "Unit",
        "Custom units"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-standard-options/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ca35f5df71c05c5973caefa1e0072b3807af2ec8",
        "sha256": "1d79d81e63f81955cf0d33dd1bd627c50a252189774bb19194b60771a90499cd",
        "lineStart": 169,
        "lineEnd": 169,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-standard-options/index.md#L169-L169"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1ac680515ed73f8db41c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can further define a custom unit with specific syntax. For example, to set a custom currency unit called \"Gems\", enter `currency:Gems` in the field. The drop-down will include the option **Custom unit: currency:Gems**:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure standard options",
        "Standard options",
        "Unit",
        "Custom units"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-standard-options/index.md",
