      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| `time:<format>`                    | Custom date time formats type, such as `time:YYYY-MM-DD`. Refer to [formats](https://momentjs.com/docs/#/displaying/) for the format syntax and options.                                                                                                                                                                                                |",
