    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d061b0d5447603e53dc7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can also paste a native emoji in the **Unit** drop-down and select it as a custom unit:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure standard options",
        "Standard options",
        "Unit",
        "Custom units"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-standard-options/index.md",
