      "sourceText": "| `${__field.displayName}`     | Same as syntax          | `Temp {Loc=\"PBI\", Sensor=\"3\"}` | Displays the field name, and labels in `{}` if they are present. If there is only one label key in the response, then for the label portion, Grafana displays the value of the label without the enclosing braces. |",
