    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.835b195c10332fa7d2f9",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| From thresholds (by value)            | The color is taken from the matching [threshold](ref:threshold). For some visualizations, you also need to choose if the color is set by the **Last**, **Min**, or **Max** value of the field or series.                                                                                                                                                                                                    |",
      "headingPath": [
