      "id": "grafana.candidate.261c556bdeb15abcb1d5",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Classic palette (by series name)      | Grafana automatically assigns colors based on the name of the series. Useful when the series names to be visualized can change based on the available data.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |",
