    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.58aac4e07c73ad61f1ea",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Multiple continuous colors (by value) | Grafana automatically assigns colors based on the percentage of a value relative to the min and the max of the field or series. For some visualizations, you also need to choose if the color is set by the **Last**, **Min**, or **Max** value of the field or series. Select from: **Green-Yellow-Red**, **Red-Yellow-Green**, **Blue-Yellow-Red**, **Yellow-Red**, **Blue-Purple**, and **Yellow-Blue**. |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure standard options",
        "Standard options",
        "Color scheme"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-standard-options/index.md",
