    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8ab63793235335d96320",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Single continuous color (by value)    | Grafana automatically assigns shades of one color based on the percentage of a value relative to the min and the max of the field or series. For some visualizations, you also need to choose if the color is set by the **Last**, **Min**, or **Max** value of the field or series. Select from: **Blues**, **Reds**, **Greens**, and **Purples**.                                                         |",
