      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Some visualizations, for example [candlestick](ref:candlestick) and [flame graph](ref:flame-graph), have tooltips, but they aren't configurable. These visualizations don't have a **Tooltip** section in the panel editor pane. [Geomaps](ref:geomaps) provide you the option to have tooltips triggered upon click or hover under the **Map controls** options in the panel editor pane.",
