    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.51373e43b2c668c57c51",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In addition to field overrides, value mapping is a technique you can use to change how data appears in a visualization.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure value mappings"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-value-mappings/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f5354caf63e5c2bce5ea20a50bf1bd77add9be7c",
        "sha256": "c5a2d32236e0b8527254f8a91c96546218016237cc9f33004475fc483cafa8b0",
        "lineStart": 97,
        "lineEnd": 97,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-value-mappings/index.md#L97-L97"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4786b46199a46a0cdedb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, the mapping applied in the following image causes the visualization to display the text `Cold`, `Good`, and `Hot` in blue, green, and red for ranges of temperatures rather than actual temperature values. Using value mappings this way can make data faster and easier to understand and interpret.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure value mappings"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-value-mappings/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f5354caf63e5c2bce5ea20a50bf1bd77add9be7c",
        "sha256": "c5a2d32236e0b8527254f8a91c96546218016237cc9f33004475fc483cafa8b0",
        "lineStart": 99,
        "lineEnd": 99,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-value-mappings/index.md#L99-L99"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9def6935f73ef29ce985",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Value mappings bypass unit formatting set in the **Standard options** section of panel editor, like color or number of decimal places displayed. When value mappings are present in a panel, Grafana displays a summary of them in the **Value mappings** section of the editor panel.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure value mappings"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-value-mappings/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f5354caf63e5c2bce5ea20a50bf1bd77add9be7c",
        "sha256": "c5a2d32236e0b8527254f8a91c96546218016237cc9f33004475fc483cafa8b0",
        "lineStart": 103,
        "lineEnd": 103,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-value-mappings/index.md#L103-L103"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5adfed37cbfb49d903a7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can configure value mappings for the following visualizations:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure value mappings",
        "Supported visualizations"
