    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f1201de88379b5d1a3b2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you first open the panel editor, Grafana analyzes your query results and suggests visualizations that suit the shape of the data. You can select a suggested visualization or click **All visualizations** to browse the full list of available panel types. After you've selected a visualization, the display options section provides further configuration.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Panel editor",
        "Panel display options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/panel-editor-overview/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9af0a8be4aeab58d807b6bcf488720d0ddb59d2d",
        "sha256": "7b79324a1d1da061b81b260dc8c9a97ff42387be973dd63d413e3391fdadc96e",
        "lineStart": 77,
        "lineEnd": 77,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/panel-editor-overview/index.md#L77-L77"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5e4ca9ac8dc13a12a8ae",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "While visualization suggestions help you choose _which_ panel type to use, panel styles help you decide _how_ that panel should look. The **Panel styles** section of the panel editor sidebar contains preconfigured options for the currently selected visualization. It appears after you've selected a visualization and the panel has data.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Panel editor",
        "Panel display options",
        "Panel styles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/panel-editor-overview/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9af0a8be4aeab58d807b6bcf488720d0ddb59d2d",
        "sha256": "7b79324a1d1da061b81b260dc8c9a97ff42387be973dd63d413e3391fdadc96e",
        "lineStart": 83,
        "lineEnd": 83,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/panel-editor-overview/index.md#L83-L83"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.24f37bbe0fb3439ddca1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Each style is displayed as a live preview card that shows how it changes the visualization. Clicking a style applies a combination of display options and field configuration to the panel. For example, changing a style might switch a time series visualization from a line chart with a gradient fill to a stacked bar chart, or update the color scheme and graph mode of a stat visualization.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Panel editor",
        "Panel display options",
        "Panel styles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/panel-editor-overview/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9af0a8be4aeab58d807b6bcf488720d0ddb59d2d",
        "sha256": "7b79324a1d1da061b81b260dc8c9a97ff42387be973dd63d413e3391fdadc96e",
        "lineStart": 87,
        "lineEnd": 87,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/panel-editor-overview/index.md#L87-L87"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2316987e53492674b5da",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Only the fields the style defines are changed.",
