    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.aae532badcee90711aa2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A Grafana panel is a visual representation of data composed of a [query](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/) and a [visualization](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/). Within panels, you can apply [transformations](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/transform-data/), which process the results of a query before they're passed on for visualization. You can also further customize a panel by formatting data and configuring visualization options.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Panel overview"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/panel-overview/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "918a82c414c166ed36e3a555440ca7eae1dbe28a",
        "sha256": "39d0d91f445677ae0793a81eb7f5dae1d9ea81d3e6831bce0e4185fc862fdc40",
        "lineStart": 25,
        "lineEnd": 25,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/panel-overview/index.md#L25-L25"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7eef8253f16518c340f2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Each panel has a query editor specific to the data source selected in the panel. The query editor allows you to build a query that returns the data you want to visualize.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Panel overview"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/panel-overview/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "918a82c414c166ed36e3a555440ca7eae1dbe28a",
        "sha256": "39d0d91f445677ae0793a81eb7f5dae1d9ea81d3e6831bce0e4185fc862fdc40",
        "lineStart": 27,
        "lineEnd": 27,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/panel-overview/index.md#L27-L27"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c2b6f4cb80f70a69b4ed",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Panels offer a wide variety of formatting and styling options, from applying colors based on field values to creating custom units. Each visualization also comes with options specific to it that give you further control over how your data is displayed. Panels can also be dragged, dropped, and resized to rearrange them on the dashboard.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Panel overview"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/panel-overview/index.md",
