      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. **Legend** - Change series colors, y-axis, and series visibility directly from the [legend](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/visualizations/panels-visualizations/configure-legend/).",
