    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0be63df9371f0f058636",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana supports many types of [data sources](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/). Data source {{< term \"query\" >}}queries{{< /term >}} return data that Grafana can {{< term \"transformation\" >}}transform{{< /term >}} and visualize. Each data source uses its own query language, and data source plugins each implement a query-building user interface called a _query editor_.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query and transform data"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "38813b0cf3aa553858163033e0590f413c59fee0",
        "sha256": "039c21b3af87b4a583dbbaf26e96f73e454c5786752285aee76d63dd1e04d172",
        "lineStart": 113,
        "lineEnd": 115,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md#L113-L115"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6bd9c3b452f856c55711",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana panels communicate with data sources using queries, which retrieve data for the visualization. A query is a question written in the query language used by the data source.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query and transform data",
        "About queries"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md",
