      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can manage saved queries as code with the Grafana Terraform provider, which lets you version-control your query library and keep it consistent across instances. For more information, refer to [Manage saved queries using Terraform](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/manage-saved-queries/).",
