    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.926a28cdbb36c4381e6b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can also rearrange the order of elements by dragging and dropping the cards in the list.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query and transform data",
        "Navigate the query editor"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md",
