      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| {{< figure src=\"/static/img/docs/queries/duplicate-query-icon-7-0.png\" max-width=\"30px\" max-height=\"30px\" alt=\"Duplicate icon\" >}} | Copies a query. Duplicating queries is useful when working with multiple complex queries that are similar and you want to either experiment with different variants or do minor alterations. Click the **More query actions** menu to access this option. |",
