    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.278a948868bc6c2c8fe3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Click **Query options** in the footer of the editor pane to see settings for the selected data source. Changes you make here affect only queries made in this panel.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query and transform data",
        "Query options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "38813b0cf3aa553858163033e0590f413c59fee0",
        "sha256": "039c21b3af87b4a583dbbaf26e96f73e454c5786752285aee76d63dd1e04d172",
        "lineStart": 377,
        "lineEnd": 378,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md#L377-L378"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.69d2ef9ea63f216754ca",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana sets defaults that are shown in dark gray text. Changes are displayed in white text. To return a field to the default setting, delete the white text from the field.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query and transform data",
        "Query options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "38813b0cf3aa553858163033e0590f413c59fee0",
        "sha256": "039c21b3af87b4a583dbbaf26e96f73e454c5786752285aee76d63dd1e04d172",
        "lineStart": 382,
        "lineEnd": 384,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md#L382-L384"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.96162c2174d1ef76f505",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the data source supports it, this sets the maximum number of data points for each series returned. If the query returns more data points than the max data points setting, then the data source reduces the number of points returned by aggregating them together by average, max, or another function.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query and transform data",
        "Query options",
        "Max data points"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "38813b0cf3aa553858163033e0590f413c59fee0",
        "sha256": "039c21b3af87b4a583dbbaf26e96f73e454c5786752285aee76d63dd1e04d172",
        "lineStart": 388,
        "lineEnd": 389,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md#L388-L389"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cfd714383fb86b59b299",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can limit the number of points to improve query performance or smooth the visualized line. The default value is the width (or number of pixels) of the graph, because you can only visualize as many data points as the graph panel has room to display.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query and transform data",
        "Query options",
        "Max data points"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "38813b0cf3aa553858163033e0590f413c59fee0",
        "sha256": "039c21b3af87b4a583dbbaf26e96f73e454c5786752285aee76d63dd1e04d172",
        "lineStart": 391,
        "lineEnd": 392,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md#L391-L392"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1dfde6c381fee2e2671b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Because the default depends on the panel’s pixel width, the same dashboard can show a different visual representation of the data depending on the panel’s size on screen. When you open a panel by clicking **View** in the panel menu, or by pressing `v`, the panel expands to fill the window. This doesn’t change the dashboard’s grid layout, but it gives the panel more pixels to render with. With more pixels, Grafana can request more data points, which increases the resolution and reduces the step size between points. As a result, the same query can return a more detailed series in view mode than in the dashboard grid.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query and transform data",
        "Query options",
        "Max data points"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "38813b0cf3aa553858163033e0590f413c59fee0",
        "sha256": "039c21b3af87b4a583dbbaf26e96f73e454c5786752285aee76d63dd1e04d172",
        "lineStart": 394,
        "lineEnd": 398,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md#L394-L398"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.522cbd22df301735f870",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To get a consistent visual representation in both views, set **Max data points** to a fixed value. For example, if you set it to `100`, Grafana requests no more than 100 points, regardless of the panel’s pixel width. This means the query resolution remains more consistent whether the panel is in the dashboard grid or in view mode.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query and transform data",
        "Query options",
        "Max data points"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "38813b0cf3aa553858163033e0590f413c59fee0",
        "sha256": "039c21b3af87b4a583dbbaf26e96f73e454c5786752285aee76d63dd1e04d172",
        "lineStart": 400,
        "lineEnd": 402,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md#L400-L402"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.848d86faf632c83b451e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Max data points** defaults to the panel’s pixel width, so resizing a panel changes how many points the data source returns. This affects not only the visual resolution, but also any values calculated from that data, such as transformations, reducer calculations (the **Calculation** option in visualizations like Stat, Gauge, and Bar gauge), and expressions. If a panel’s computed value shifts with its size, set **Max data points** to a fixed value, or set **Min interval** to stabilize the resolution.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query and transform data",
        "Query options",
        "Max data points"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "38813b0cf3aa553858163033e0590f413c59fee0",
        "sha256": "039c21b3af87b4a583dbbaf26e96f73e454c5786752285aee76d63dd1e04d172",
        "lineStart": 405,
        "lineEnd": 405,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md#L405-L405"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2d602c4edd197467cba7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Sets a minimum limit for the automatically calculated interval, which is typically the minimum scrape interval. If a data point is saved every 15 seconds, you don't benefit from having an interval lower than that. You can also set this to a higher minimum than the scrape interval to retrieve queries that are more coarse-grained and well-functioning.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query and transform data",
        "Query options",
        "Min interval"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "38813b0cf3aa553858163033e0590f413c59fee0",
        "sha256": "039c21b3af87b4a583dbbaf26e96f73e454c5786752285aee76d63dd1e04d172",
        "lineStart": 414,
        "lineEnd": 416,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md#L414-L416"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.927e63aebfc996887ca0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The **Min interval** corresponds to the min step in Prometheus. Changing the Prometheus interval can change the start and end of the query range because Prometheus aligns the range to the interval. Refer to [Min step](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/prometheus/query-editor/#min-step) for more details.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query and transform data",
        "Query options",
        "Min interval"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "38813b0cf3aa553858163033e0590f413c59fee0",
        "sha256": "039c21b3af87b4a583dbbaf26e96f73e454c5786752285aee76d63dd1e04d172",
        "lineStart": 419,
        "lineEnd": 419,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md#L419-L419"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bb41b640d3f8f68492e8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Sets a time span that you can use when aggregating or grouping data points by time.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query and transform data",
        "Query options",
        "Interval"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "38813b0cf3aa553858163033e0590f413c59fee0",
        "sha256": "039c21b3af87b4a583dbbaf26e96f73e454c5786752285aee76d63dd1e04d172",
        "lineStart": 424,
        "lineEnd": 424,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md#L424-L424"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.efcc20e54dcc60e85bec",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana automatically calculates an appropriate interval that you can use as a variable in templated queries. The variable is measured in either seconds (`$__interval`) or milliseconds (`$__interval_ms`).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query and transform data",
        "Query options",
        "Interval"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "38813b0cf3aa553858163033e0590f413c59fee0",
        "sha256": "039c21b3af87b4a583dbbaf26e96f73e454c5786752285aee76d63dd1e04d172",
        "lineStart": 426,
        "lineEnd": 427,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md#L426-L427"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.66e65badbce56ed86a34",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Intervals are typically used in aggregation functions like sum or average. For example, this is a Prometheus query that uses the interval variable: `rate(http_requests_total[$__interval])`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query and transform data",
        "Query options",
        "Interval"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "38813b0cf3aa553858163033e0590f413c59fee0",
        "sha256": "039c21b3af87b4a583dbbaf26e96f73e454c5786752285aee76d63dd1e04d172",
        "lineStart": 429,
        "lineEnd": 430,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md#L429-L430"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.55ba4fbe4b2112f568a3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This automatic interval is calculated based on the width of the graph. As the user zooms out on a visualization, the interval grows, resulting in a more coarse-grained aggregation. Likewise, if the user zooms in, the interval decreases, resulting in a more fine-grained aggregation.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query and transform data",
        "Query options",
        "Interval"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "38813b0cf3aa553858163033e0590f413c59fee0",
        "sha256": "039c21b3af87b4a583dbbaf26e96f73e454c5786752285aee76d63dd1e04d172",
        "lineStart": 432,
        "lineEnd": 434,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md#L432-L434"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.811cbe7e3d5a6a74b56a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For more information, refer to [Global variables](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/visualizations/dashboards/variables/add-template-variables/#global-variables).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query and transform data",
        "Query options",
        "Interval"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "38813b0cf3aa553858163033e0590f413c59fee0",
        "sha256": "039c21b3af87b4a583dbbaf26e96f73e454c5786752285aee76d63dd1e04d172",
        "lineStart": 436,
        "lineEnd": 436,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md#L436-L436"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.23469015c3e43c4d18a8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Overrides the relative time range for individual panels, which causes them to be different than what is selected in the dashboard time picker in the top-right corner of the dashboard. You can use this to show metrics from different time periods or days on the same dashboard.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query and transform data",
        "Query options",
        "Relative time"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "38813b0cf3aa553858163033e0590f413c59fee0",
        "sha256": "039c21b3af87b4a583dbbaf26e96f73e454c5786752285aee76d63dd1e04d172",
        "lineStart": 440,
        "lineEnd": 441,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/_index.md#L440-L441"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f5610b3f2ecda0eb5511",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Panel time overrides have no effect when the dashboard's time range is absolute.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Query and transform data",
        "Query options",
        "Relative time"
      ],
