    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.91a5ef963a4a8813749f",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- A collection of numbers, where each number is an item.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Write expression queries",
        "About expressions",
        "Types of expressions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/expression-queries/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4222371df2702e2afb05fd16ba44d19780fdbd11",
        "sha256": "ab785d3ab03444a008cdfce52ad98410ccea4866718eea0589d09908c8fa86a1",
        "lineStart": 72,
        "lineEnd": 72,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/expression-queries/index.md#L72-L72"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a8d3c2204496ac6c1911",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Each collection is returned from a single data source query or expression and represented by the RefID. Each collection is a set, where each item in the set is uniquely identified by its dimensions which are stored as [labels](ref:labels) or key-value pairs.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Write expression queries",
        "About expressions",
        "Types of expressions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/expression-queries/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4222371df2702e2afb05fd16ba44d19780fdbd11",
        "sha256": "ab785d3ab03444a008cdfce52ad98410ccea4866718eea0589d09908c8fa86a1",
        "lineStart": 74,
        "lineEnd": 74,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/expression-queries/index.md#L74-L74"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.289f5fe690a4e6a1f2eb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Server-side expressions only support data source queries for backend data sources. The data is generally assumed to be labeled time series data. In the future we intend to add an assertion of the query return type (number or time series) data so expressions can handle errors better.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Write expression queries",
        "About expressions",
        "Data source queries"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/expression-queries/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4222371df2702e2afb05fd16ba44d19780fdbd11",
        "sha256": "ab785d3ab03444a008cdfce52ad98410ccea4866718eea0589d09908c8fa86a1",
        "lineStart": 78,
        "lineEnd": 78,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/expression-queries/index.md#L78-L78"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2c6765ec5859cfcacbef",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Data source queries, when used with expressions, are executed by the expression engine. When it does this, it restructures data to be either one time series or one number per data frame. So for example if using a data source that returns multiple series on one frame in the table view, you might notice it looks different when executed with expressions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Write expression queries",
        "About expressions",
        "Data source queries"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/expression-queries/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "4222371df2702e2afb05fd16ba44d19780fdbd11",
        "sha256": "ab785d3ab03444a008cdfce52ad98410ccea4866718eea0589d09908c8fa86a1",
        "lineStart": 80,
        "lineEnd": 80,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/expression-queries/index.md#L80-L80"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.42bce92679ee4f45829b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Currently, the only non-time series format (number) is supported when you're using data frames and you have a table response that returns a data frame with no time, string columns, and one number column:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Write expression queries",
        "About expressions",
        "Data source queries"
      ],
