      "id": "grafana.candidate.9d86eafb44bda2c865ed",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- If both `$A` and `$B` are time series data, then the operation between each value in the two series is performed for each time stamp that exists in both `$A` and `$B`. The Resample operation can be used to line up time stamps. (**Note:** in the future, we plan to add options to the Math operation for different behaviors).",
