      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "So if you have numbers with labels like `{host=web01}` in `$A` and another number in `$B` with the same labels then the operation is performed between those two items within each variable, and the result will share the same labels. The rules for the behavior of this union are as follows:",
