      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "is_number takes a number or a series and returns `1` for all real number values and `0` for other values (which are `null`, `Inf+`, `Inf-`, and `NaN`). For example `is_number($A)`.",
      "headingPath": [
