      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Dashboard data source lets you select a panel in your dashboard that contains the queries ‌you want to share the results for. Instead of sending a separate query for each panel, Grafana sends one query and other panels use the query results to construct visualizations.",
      "headingPath": [
