    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ed934c926624c23daff5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After you have added a SQL expression, you can select from other data source queries by referencing the RefIDs of the queries in your SQL expression as if they were tables in a SQL database.",
      "headingPath": [
        "SQL expressions",
        "Create SQL expressions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/sql-expressions/index.md",
