      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. **Build your base queries.** Create the individual query and give it a meaningful name. Create the queries (A, B, etc.) that provide the data you want to combine or transform using SQL Expressions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "SQL expressions",
        "Workflow to build SQL expressions"
      ],
