      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The editor autocompletes SQL keywords, [supported functions](#supported-functions), and the RefIDs of your other queries as table names. Column autocomplete is experimental and requires the `sqlExpressionsColumnAutoComplete` feature toggle. When enabled, the editor suggests column names by querying your data sources for their fields.",
