    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8446ebfa59d2c2dc7dad",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Input cells**: The total number of cells, that is rows multiplied by columns, across all referenced queries can't exceed `sql_expression_cell_limit`. The default is `100000`. If the input exceeds this limit, the query fails.",
      "headingPath": [
        "SQL expressions",
        "Known limitations",
        "Query limits"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/sql-expressions/index.md",
