    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0bf565f8ce2f8b41784d",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Error responses**: When a data source query returns an error, SQL expressions cannot interpret the result.",
      "headingPath": [
        "SQL expressions",
        "Known limitations",
        "Schema changes and missing data"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/sql-expressions/index.md",
