    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fc1936afcb6bb4e280bb",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Dynamic schema responses**: If the set of columns or labels changes between query executions, SQL expressions may fail because it treats column changes as schema changes.",
      "headingPath": [
        "SQL expressions",
        "Known limitations",
        "Schema changes and missing data"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/sql-expressions/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3e545e4b2f9dfa0e933cbe79b173d05a64036723",
        "sha256": "f821b02e2b87c25ad95fd5dee78a7973144d794c06fd2c6fcad576ccf23ed53d",
        "lineStart": 336,
        "lineEnd": 336,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/sql-expressions/index.md#L336-L336"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4d7b56f020464479437f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "An embedded SQL engine powers SQL expressions, treating each query result as a table. Grafana derives the schema of that table from the columns that the underlying data source returns.",
      "headingPath": [
        "SQL expressions",
        "Known limitations",
        "Schema changes and missing data"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/sql-expressions/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3e545e4b2f9dfa0e933cbe79b173d05a64036723",
        "sha256": "f821b02e2b87c25ad95fd5dee78a7973144d794c06fd2c6fcad576ccf23ed53d",
        "lineStart": 338,
        "lineEnd": 338,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/sql-expressions/index.md#L338-L338"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6c2047c000f4c706c921",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Unlike traditional SQL databases, where schemas are usually fixed, many Grafana data sources (for example, Prometheus) can return results with varying label sets or no data at all.",
      "headingPath": [
        "SQL expressions",
        "Known limitations",
        "Schema changes and missing data"
      ],
      "source": {
