    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.40e0a64222b47f553333",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Improve query**: Suggests performance, reliability, and readability enhancements, and fixes syntax errors. If you haven't written a query yet, this appears as **Generate suggestion** and proposes a starting query, such as a join, aggregation, filter, percentile, or time-based window function, using your available queries.",
      "headingPath": [
        "SQL expressions",
