    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.be9a28f9aff4ce492a70",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Transformations are a powerful way to manipulate data returned by a query before the system applies a visualization. Using transformations, you can:",
