      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.62577ec04b07dcf16dc0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana provides a number of ways that you can transform data. For a complete list of transformations, refer to [Transformation functions](#transformation-functions).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Transform data",
        "Transformation types"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/transform-data/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9cd072609170b1783ea50740845dd11e18b0fede",
        "sha256": "73ae12b953aaf13c6df7b5a072cc18677d57c977343a108001752487a81b2800",
        "lineStart": 104,
        "lineEnd": 104,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/transform-data/index.md#L104-L104"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b5ede9b227c8056e14c3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When there are multiple transformations, Grafana applies them in the order they are listed. Each transformation creates a result set that then passes on to the next transformation in the processing pipeline.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Transform data",
        "Order of transformations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/transform-data/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9cd072609170b1783ea50740845dd11e18b0fede",
        "sha256": "73ae12b953aaf13c6df7b5a072cc18677d57c977343a108001752487a81b2800",
        "lineStart": 108,
        "lineEnd": 108,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/transform-data/index.md#L108-L108"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bdcf7e340cf3d65c0af2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The order in which Grafana applies transformations directly impacts the results. For example, if you use a Reduce transformation to condense all the results of one column into a single value, then you can only apply transformations to that single value.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Transform data",
        "Order of transformations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/transform-data/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9cd072609170b1783ea50740845dd11e18b0fede",
        "sha256": "73ae12b953aaf13c6df7b5a072cc18677d57c977343a108001752487a81b2800",
        "lineStart": 110,
        "lineEnd": 110,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/transform-data/index.md#L110-L110"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b12d5e4ab6130a92ab90",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you use dashboard variables in transformations, the variables are automatically interpolated before the transformations are applied to the data.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Transform data",
        "Dashboard variables in transformations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/transform-data/index.md",
