      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Use this transformation to select a query and extract standard options, such as **Min**, **Max**, **Unit**, and **Thresholds**, and apply them to other query results. This feature enables dynamic visualization configuration based on the data returned by a specific query.",
