      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Use this transformation to customize the output of a time field. Output can be formatted using [Moment.js format strings](https://momentjs.com/docs/#/displaying/). For example, if you want to display only the year of a time field, the format string 'YYYY' can be used to show the calendar year (for example, 1999 or 2012).",
