      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This transformation goes in two steps. First you specify one or multiple fields to group the data by. This will group all the same values of those fields together, as if you sorted them. For instance if we group by the Server ID field, then it would group the data this way:",
