      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Use this transformation to construct a matrix by specifying fields from your query results. The matrix output reflects the relationships between the unique values in these fields. This helps you present complex relationships in a clear and structured matrix format.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Transform data",
